



<p><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1" id="v1" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1" tabindex="-1">v1</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>2v Eines liedeſ ich beginne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2" id="v2" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2" tabindex="-1">v2</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in ſente Marien minne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3" id="v3" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3" tabindex="-1">v3</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der ewigen chuniginne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4" id="v4" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4" tabindex="-1">v4</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div gerûche o<span>v</span>ch min sinne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5" id="v5" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5" tabindex="-1">v5</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vnd mine bruſte erreinen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v6" id="v6" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v6" tabindex="-1">v6</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uor allerſlahte mæile<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v7" id="v7" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v7" tabindex="-1">v7</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ich nu<span>o</span> mûze ſcriben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v8" id="v8" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v8" tabindex="-1">v8</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v8
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uon ir div allen wiben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v9" id="v9" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v9" tabindex="-1">v9</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v9
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die itewize hat benomen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v10" id="v10" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v10" tabindex="-1">v10</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v10
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz der tot was bechomen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v11" id="v11" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v11" tabindex="-1">v11</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v11
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uon dem erſten wibe in die werlte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v12" id="v12" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v12" tabindex="-1">v12</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v12
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſit wart div here maget erwelte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v13" id="v13" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v13" tabindex="-1">v13</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v13
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>dar zu daz bediu man vnt wîp<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v14" id="v14" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v14" tabindex="-1">v14</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v14
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz lieht vnd den ewigen lip<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v15" id="v15" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v15" tabindex="-1">v15</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v15
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit der warheit mu<span>o</span>ſe ſcho<span>v</span>wen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v16" id="v16" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v16" tabindex="-1">v16</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v16
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da zir vil tivrer fro<span>v</span>en<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v17
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v17" id="v17" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v17" tabindex="-1">v17</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v18
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſi gebar den waren ſunnen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v18" id="v18" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v18" tabindex="-1">v18</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v19
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſi ist aller gnaden wnne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v19" id="v19" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v19" tabindex="-1">v19</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v20
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wie wol ſi iz allez underuie<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v20" id="v20" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v20" tabindex="-1">v20</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v21
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſwaz eua sunden ie begie<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v21" id="v21" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v21" tabindex="-1">v21</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v22
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wan ſi hat gebu<span>o</span>zet wol den ual<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v22" id="v22" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v22" tabindex="-1">v22</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v23
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ir chuſke luhtet uber al<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v23" id="v23" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v23" tabindex="-1">v23</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v24
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nu ſchulen ir getruen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v24" id="v24" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v24" tabindex="-1">v24</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v25
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wande wir in dem tode bûwen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v25" id="v25" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v25" tabindex="-1">v25</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v26
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ſi unſ ellenden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v26" id="v26" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v26" tabindex="-1">v26</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v27
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mege wider heim geſenden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v27" id="v27" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v27" tabindex="-1">v27</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v28
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>unt uns geruche wisen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v28" id="v28" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v28" tabindex="-1">v28</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v29
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>zu dem vrônen paradiſe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v29" id="v29" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v29" tabindex="-1">v29</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v30
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da fro<span>v</span>e eua uz geuiel<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v30" id="v30" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v30" tabindex="-1">v30</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v31
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ab dem mere chan ſi den chiel<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v31" id="v31" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v31" tabindex="-1">v31</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v32
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wol bringen vnt geleiten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v32" id="v32" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v32" tabindex="-1">v32</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v33
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vz den ſorgen unt den 3r arbeiten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v33" id="v33" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v33" tabindex="-1">v33</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v34
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>zeder himeliſchen borte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v34" id="v34" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v34" tabindex="-1">v34</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v35
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit dem gotes worte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v35" id="v35" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v35" tabindex="-1">v35</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v36
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ir wart div warheit geſaget<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v36" id="v36" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v36" tabindex="-1">v36</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v37
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſie iſt mu<span>o</span>ter und maget<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v37" id="v37" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v37" tabindex="-1">v37</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v38
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſine hat der engel niht betrogen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v38" id="v38" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v38" tabindex="-1">v38</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v39
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>got hat daz ir ſpunne geſogen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v39" id="v39" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v39" tabindex="-1">v39</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v40
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>abe ir uil reinen bruſten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v40" id="v40" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v40" tabindex="-1">v40</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v41
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die mannes nie geluſte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v41" id="v41" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v41" tabindex="-1">v41</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v42
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>noh nehêiner ſunden teil<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v42" id="v42" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v42" tabindex="-1">v42</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v43
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſie iſt iemer muter ane mæil<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v43" id="v43" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v43" tabindex="-1">v43</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v44
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uon ewen unt ze êwen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v44" id="v44" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v44" tabindex="-1">v44</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v45
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wir ſchulen ſie anru<span>o</span>fen ν flegen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v45" id="v45" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v45" tabindex="-1">v45</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v46
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Himeliſchiv frowe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v46" id="v46" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v46" tabindex="-1">v46</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v47
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit geiſtlichem tôwe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v47" id="v47" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v47" tabindex="-1">v47</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v48
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>begiuz den minen gedanch<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v48" id="v48" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v48" tabindex="-1">v48</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v49
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ich din lob vnd din geſanch<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v49" id="v49" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v49" tabindex="-1">v49</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v50
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ein teil gemeren mu<span>o</span>zze<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v50" id="v50" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v50" tabindex="-1">v50</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v51
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>unt hilf mir daz ich gebuzze<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v51" id="v51" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v51" tabindex="-1">v51</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v52
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz unreht daz ich ie begie<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v52" id="v52" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v52" tabindex="-1">v52</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v53
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wan ich gezwiuelot nie<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v53" id="v53" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v53" tabindex="-1">v53</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v54
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>an dir noh andinem chinde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v54" id="v54" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v54" tabindex="-1">v54</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v55
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des la mich gnade vinden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v56
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v55" id="v55" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v55" tabindex="-1">v55</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v57
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vnt la mich o<span>v</span>ch geniezen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v56" id="v56" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v56" tabindex="-1">v56</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v58
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz du nie <span class="unclear">[…]ze</span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v57" id="v57" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v57" tabindex="-1">v57</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v59
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>deheinen irdiſken man<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v58" id="v58" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v58" tabindex="-1">v58</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v60
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der dich ze uoget wolte han<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v59" id="v59" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v59" tabindex="-1">v59</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v61
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>du biſt liehter denne der tach<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v60" id="v60" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v60" tabindex="-1">v60</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v62
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>aller tuogende wâz unt ſmach<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v61" id="v61" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v61" tabindex="-1">v61</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v63
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>flivzet uz diner ſc<span class="del">h</span>ozze<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v62" id="v62" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v62" tabindex="-1">v62</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v64
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nu bedenche fro<span>v</span>e gzze<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v63" id="v63" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v63" tabindex="-1">v63</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v65
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>waz dir der engel brahte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v64" id="v64" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v64" tabindex="-1">v64</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v66
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do got an dir bedahte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v65" id="v65" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v65" tabindex="-1">v65</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v67
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>aller menniſken not<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v66" id="v66" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v66" tabindex="-1">v66</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v68
