         </span>daz ſie bi ſo reinem man<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v490" id="v490" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v490" tabindex="-1">v490</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v551
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nie herzeliep mit kinde gewan<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v491" id="v491" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v491" tabindex="-1">v491</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v552
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vnt dazu bi im lebentigen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v492" id="v492" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v492" tabindex="-1">v492</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v553
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ſi witewe ſolt geligen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v493" id="v493" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v493" tabindex="-1">v493</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v554
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz waren ſorgen ungefûge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v494" id="v494" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v494" tabindex="-1">v494</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v555
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die nehein lip ſamfte truge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v556
