         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v495" id="v495" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v495" tabindex="-1">v495</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v559
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do muſe erbleichen danne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v496" id="v496" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v496" tabindex="-1">v496</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v560
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div ſchone  div gute fro<span>v</span>e anne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v497" id="v497" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v497" tabindex="-1">v497</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v561
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ir liehti<span>v</span> varwe uerdarp<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v498" id="v498" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v498" tabindex="-1">v498</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v562
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>al ir fro<span>v</span>de erſtarp<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v499" id="v499" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v499" tabindex="-1">v499</a>
