         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v503" id="v503" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v503" tabindex="-1">v503</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v573
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>du ruche mih arme bedenchen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v504" id="v504" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v504" tabindex="-1">v504</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v574
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>íane mag ich niht gewenchen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v505" id="v505" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v505" tabindex="-1">v505</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v575
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ihen muze liden ſwaz du wil <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v506" id="v506" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v506" tabindex="-1">v506</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v576
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ia han ich angeſte vil<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v507" id="v507" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v507" tabindex="-1">v507</a>
