         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v577
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wâ mæh<span class="unclear">t</span> ich reſte vinden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v508" id="v508" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v508" tabindex="-1">v508</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v578
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do du mir an den kinden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v509" id="v509" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v509" tabindex="-1">v509</a>
