         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v589
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſwaz du wil daz muz ergen <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v516" id="v516" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v516" tabindex="-1">v516</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v590
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die toten heizeſt dv ufſtên<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v517" id="v517" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v517" tabindex="-1">v517</a>
