         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v606
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>gezalt haſtu al die ſterne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v528" id="v528" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v528" tabindex="-1">v528</a>
