         </span>dune darft mih andingen ni<span>e</span>ht<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v807" id="v807" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v807" tabindex="-1">v807</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v960
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ich die dine ſpiſe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v808" id="v808" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v808" tabindex="-1">v808</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v961
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>zu minem munde wîſe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v809" id="v809" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v809" tabindex="-1">v809</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v962
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nu brinch der gotes chrefte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v810" id="v810" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v810" tabindex="-1">v810</a>
