         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v963
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſwaz du zewirtſchefte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v811" id="v811" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v811" tabindex="-1">v811</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v964
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mir hivte woldeſt bieten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v812" id="v812" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v812" tabindex="-1">v812</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v965
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſo maht du dih gnaden nieten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
