         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v813" id="v813" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v813" tabindex="-1">v813</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v969
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uon dines ſchepfæres gewalte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v814" id="v814" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v814" tabindex="-1">v814</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v970
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der din gu<span>o</span>te hat gezalte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v815" id="v815" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v815" tabindex="-1">v815</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v971
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und allez din almuſen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v816" id="v816" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v816" tabindex="-1">v816</a>
