         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v972
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>treit inſin buſem<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v817" id="v817" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v817" tabindex="-1">v817</a>
