         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v974
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſit du ſin gevîenge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v819" id="v819" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v819" tabindex="-1">v819</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v975
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz du im chundeſt gedienen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v820" id="v820" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v820" tabindex="-1">v820</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v976
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er wil o<span>v</span>h dich erchennen  liebeN<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v821" id="v821" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v821" tabindex="-1">v821</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v977
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Der herre ilent gie<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v822" id="v822" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v822" tabindex="-1">v822</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v978
