         </span>ein læmbel er geuîe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v823" id="v823" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v823" tabindex="-1">v823</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v979
