         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v984
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſwaz ich nu han geſund&amp;<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v829" id="v829" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v829" tabindex="-1">v829</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v985
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da hilf mir uon durh din gute<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v830" id="v830" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v830" tabindex="-1">v830</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v986
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ich mit reinem gemu<span>o</span>te<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
