         </span>23vmit allem ir gezôwe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1221" id="v1221" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1221" tabindex="-1">v1221</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1574
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nu rufet ſie <span class="del">u</span>an alle<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1222" id="v1222" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1222" tabindex="-1">v1222</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1575
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uon herzen niht mit des mundes ſchalle<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1576
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1223" id="v1223" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1223" tabindex="-1">v1223</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1577
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da ſie nu ſint gefuret<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1224" id="v1224" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1224" tabindex="-1">v1224</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1578
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uon dem tievil umberuret<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1579
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1580
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1225" id="v1225" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1225" tabindex="-1">v1225</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1581
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz daz heilige ingeſide<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1226" id="v1226" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1226" tabindex="-1">v1226</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1582
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uor hazze ioh uor nide<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1227" id="v1227" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1227" tabindex="-1">v1227</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1583
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>unſ armen ruche enbinden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1228" id="v1228" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1228" tabindex="-1">v1228</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1584
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz wir ſie hernah vinden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1585
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1229" id="v1229" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1229" tabindex="-1">v1229</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1586
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in den himiliſken eren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1230" id="v1230" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1230" tabindex="-1">v1230</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1587
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ſo wir uzem ellende chereN A<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1231" id="v1231" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1231" tabindex="-1">v1231</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1588
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Nv nernemet die senften lere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1232" id="v1232" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1232" tabindex="-1">v1232</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1589
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uon der magede here<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1233" id="v1233" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1233" tabindex="-1">v1233</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1590
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div uns den heilant gebar<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1234" id="v1234" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1234" tabindex="-1">v1234</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1591
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>gutiv herze heuet ivh dar<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1235" id="v1235" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1235" tabindex="-1">v1235</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1592
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da ir daz hseil gwinnet 1235<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1593
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1236" id="v1236" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1236" tabindex="-1">v1236</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1594
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des iv niemer cerinnet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1237" id="v1237" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1237" tabindex="-1">v1237</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1595
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>bittet sie der undirdige<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1596
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1597
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1238" id="v1238" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1238" tabindex="-1">v1238</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1598
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie flehliken lige<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1239" id="v1239" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1239" tabindex="-1">v1239</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1599
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ir trut sun an dem fuze<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1240" id="v1240" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1240" tabindex="-1">v1240</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1600
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>untze er uns gebuzze 1240<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1241" id="v1241" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1241" tabindex="-1">v1241</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1601
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>unser leit unt unser sere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1242" id="v1242" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1242" tabindex="-1">v1242</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1602
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der pfaffe heizet Wernhere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1243" id="v1243" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1243" tabindex="-1">v1243</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1603
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der des lides began<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1244" id="v1244" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1244" tabindex="-1">v1244</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1604
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uon dem er urchunde nam<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1245" id="v1245" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1245" tabindex="-1">v1245</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1605
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der ist 5h uon Christe 1245<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1246" id="v1246" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1246" tabindex="-1">v1246</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1606
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>zeinem ç wangeliste<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1247" id="v1247" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1247" tabindex="-1">v1247</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1607
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>gesegent ν gewihet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1248" id="v1248" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1248" tabindex="-1">v1248</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1608
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nieman ime des uerzihet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1249" id="v1249" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1249" tabindex="-1">v1249</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1609
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Matheus ist der orthabe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1250" id="v1250" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1250" tabindex="-1">v1250</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1610
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der ratet daz man uz trage 1250<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1251" id="v1251" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1251" tabindex="-1">v1251</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1611
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die margariten an das lieht<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1252" id="v1252" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1252" tabindex="-1">v1252</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1612
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie werde uertunchelt nieht<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1253" id="v1253" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1253" tabindex="-1">v1253</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1613
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in dem irdiskem stöbe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1254" id="v1254" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1254" tabindex="-1">v1254</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1614
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ia hilf et uns der globe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1255" id="v1255" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1255" tabindex="-1">v1255</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1615
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den wir zu der kuniginne han 1255<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1256" id="v1256" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1256" tabindex="-1">v1256</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1616
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so wir dem tievil widerstan<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1257" id="v1257" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1257" tabindex="-1">v1257</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1617
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sie ist des himels froe ν brut<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1618
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1619
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1620
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1621
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1622
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1623
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1624
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1625
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1258" id="v1258" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1258" tabindex="-1">v1258</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1626
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sie beschirmet wol daz livt<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1259" id="v1259" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1259" tabindex="-1">v1259</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1627
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und alle ir undertane<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1260" id="v1260" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1260" tabindex="-1">v1260</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1628
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die getut sie sorgen ane 1260<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1261" id="v1261" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1261" tabindex="-1">v1261</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1629
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sie hat den heiligen daz Ion<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1262" id="v1262" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1262" tabindex="-1">v1262</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1630
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>gemert mit des lebens chrôn<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1631
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1263" id="v1263" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1263" tabindex="-1">v1263</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1632
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wand allez mannes chunne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1264" id="v1264" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1264" tabindex="-1">v1264</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1633
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ienoh ze helle brunne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1265" id="v1265" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1265" tabindex="-1">v1265</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1634
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ware in div maget niht chomen 1265<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1266" id="v1266" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1266" tabindex="-1">v1266</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1635
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div sie uzer not hat genomen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1267" id="v1267" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1267" tabindex="-1">v1267</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1636
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sie ist ein christalle<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1268" id="v1268" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1268" tabindex="-1">v1268</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1637
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>über die engil alle<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1269" id="v1269" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1269" tabindex="-1">v1269</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1638
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ein liehtvaz in der vinster<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1270" id="v1270" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1270" tabindex="-1">v1270</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1639
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sie zuchet uns uon der winster 1270<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1271" id="v1271" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1271" tabindex="-1">v1271</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1640
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz wir zeswenthalben gesten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1272" id="v1272" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1272" tabindex="-1">v1272</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1641
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so wir an daz gerihte gen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1273" id="v1273" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1273" tabindex="-1">v1273</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1642
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>alle ir uolgoere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1274" id="v1274" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1274" tabindex="-1">v1274</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1643
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nv bittet den sagerare<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1644
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1645
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1275" id="v1275" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1275" tabindex="-1">v1275</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1646
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den der heilig geist begoz 1275<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1276" id="v1276" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1276" tabindex="-1">v1276</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1647
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie mine sunde also groz<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1277" id="v1277" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1277" tabindex="-1">v1277</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1648
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit gnaden wol bed eche<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1278" id="v1278" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1278" tabindex="-1">v1278</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1649
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>untz ih div herze erweche<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1279" id="v1279" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1279" tabindex="-1">v1279</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1650
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div noh slafende sint<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1280" id="v1280" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1280" tabindex="-1">v1280</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1651
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>(laz sie erchennen daz kint 1280<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1281" id="v1281" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1281" tabindex="-1">v1281</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1652
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie mit armen umbevie<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1282" id="v1282" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1282" tabindex="-1">v1282</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1653
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do sie ze keminaten gie<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1283" id="v1283" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1283" tabindex="-1">v1283</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1654
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>bi der smahen krippe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1284" id="v1284" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1284" tabindex="-1">v1284</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1655
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do wart Adames rippe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1285" id="v1285" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1285" tabindex="-1">v1285</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1656
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>an der froen wol geeret 1285<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1286" id="v1286" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1286" tabindex="-1">v1286</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1657
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sie hat uns alle frode gemeret<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1287" id="v1287" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1287" tabindex="-1">v1287</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1658
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Do saente Marie<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1288" id="v1288" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1288" tabindex="-1">v1288</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1659
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div edile vnt div frie<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1289" id="v1289" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1289" tabindex="-1">v1289</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1660
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div maget unberuret<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1290" id="v1290" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1290" tabindex="-1">v1290</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1661
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>zu dem templo wart gefuret 1290<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1662
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1663
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1291" id="v1291" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1291" tabindex="-1">v1291</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1664
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in der stat ze Ierusalem<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1292" id="v1292" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1292" tabindex="-1">v1292</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1665
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ir ere begunde do uf gen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1666
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1293" id="v1293" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1293" tabindex="-1">v1293</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1667
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>erkant wart sie witen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1294" id="v1294" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1294" tabindex="-1">v1294</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1668
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wände sie in denselben ziten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1295" id="v1295" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1295" tabindex="-1">v1295</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1669
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>erluhte sam div sunne 1295<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1296" id="v1296" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1296" tabindex="-1">v1296</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1670
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uz allem ir chunne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1297" id="v1297" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1297" tabindex="-1">v1297</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1671
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>30 ir antlutze was so tugentliche<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1298" id="v1298" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1298" tabindex="-1">v1298</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1672
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ir ogen also kunchliche<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1299" id="v1299" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1299" tabindex="-1">v1299</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1673
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ir geboerde also reine<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1300" id="v1300" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1300" tabindex="-1">v1300</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1674
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sih zv ir glichte dehêine 1300<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1301" id="v1301" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1301" tabindex="-1">v1301</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1675
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>under allen den froen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1676
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1302" id="v1302" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1302" tabindex="-1">v1302</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1677
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sie mvsen anscôen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1303" id="v1303" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1303" tabindex="-1">v1303</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1678
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div livte mit uorhten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1304" id="v1304" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1304" tabindex="-1">v1304</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1679
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>swa andere froen worhten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1305" id="v1305" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1305" tabindex="-1">v1305</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1680
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>linwat unde siden 1305<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1306" id="v1306" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1306" tabindex="-1">v1306</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1681
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ir nehemiv maht erliden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1307" id="v1307" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1307" tabindex="-1">v1307</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1682
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>16335 also vil der arbeit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1308" id="v1308" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1308" tabindex="-1">v1308</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1683
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so ditze kint frolicken leit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1309" id="v1309" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1309" tabindex="-1">v1309</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1684
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den tempelherren ze minne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1685
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1686
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1310" id="v1310" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1310" tabindex="-1">v1310</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1687
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sie worhte mit richem sinne 1310<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1311" id="v1311" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1311" tabindex="-1">v1311</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1688
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>al des sie begunde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1312" id="v1312" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1312" tabindex="-1">v1312</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1689
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>swaz so wibes haut chunde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1690
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1313" id="v1313" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1313" tabindex="-1">v1313</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1691
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz enmahte ir niht engân<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1314" id="v1314" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1314" tabindex="-1">v1314</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1692
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des nahtes ilte sie ufstan<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1315" id="v1315" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1315" tabindex="-1">v1315</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1693
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie ir venige pflaege 1315<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1316" id="v1316" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1316" tabindex="-1">v1316</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1694
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vnde sih got ergoebe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1317" id="v1317" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1317" tabindex="-1">v1317</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1695
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>40 ir site ν ir gewonheit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1318" id="v1318" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1318" tabindex="-1">v1318</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1696
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die sage ih iv gereit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1319" id="v1319" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1319" tabindex="-1">v1319</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1697
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>alle morgen vil frû<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1320" id="v1320" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1320" tabindex="-1">v1320</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1698
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so gedahte sie darzu 1320<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1321" id="v1321" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1321" tabindex="-1">v1321</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1699
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie ir gebetes hüte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1322" id="v1322" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1322" tabindex="-1">v1322</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1700
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div reine ν div gute<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1701
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1323" id="v1323" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1323" tabindex="-1">v1323</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1702
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>1641 mit michelme flize<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1324" id="v1324" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1324" tabindex="-1">v1324</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1703
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>untze zu dem inbizze<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1325" id="v1325" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1325" tabindex="-1">v1325</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1704
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so die froen gazzen 1325<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1326" id="v1326" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1326" tabindex="-1">v1326</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1705
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vìi wider an ir werh gesazzen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1327" id="v1327" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1327" tabindex="-1">v1327</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1706
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den half sie untze an die none<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1328" id="v1328" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1328" tabindex="-1">v1328</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1707
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so gie sie aue schone<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1329" id="v1329" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1329" tabindex="-1">v1329</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1708
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>hin fur den altsere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1330" id="v1330" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1330" tabindex="-1">v1330</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1709
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie ir salter laere 1330<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
