         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1713
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz gesanch anvîengen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1334" id="v1334" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1334" tabindex="-1">v1334</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1714
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν ir tagezit begiengen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1335" id="v1335" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1335" tabindex="-1">v1335</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1715
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so chom geflogen Gabriel 1335<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1336" id="v1336" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1336" tabindex="-1">v1336</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1716
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
