         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1717
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er braht oh ir daz himelbrot<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1338" id="v1338" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1338" tabindex="-1">v1338</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1718
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz er der ivnchfröen bot<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1339" id="v1339" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1339" tabindex="-1">v1339</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1719
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz noz sie mit kivshem libe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1340" id="v1340" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1340" tabindex="-1">v1340</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1720
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div nie wart ze wibe 1340<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
