         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1722
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>anders aze sie niht vil<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1342" id="v1342" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1342" tabindex="-1">v1342</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1723
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
