         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1778
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>kivsche diemût vnde stsete<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1378" id="v1378" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1378" tabindex="-1">v1378</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1779
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die dri tvgende sie haete<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1379" id="v1379" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1379" tabindex="-1">v1379</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1780
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit den andern uzerchorn<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1380" id="v1380" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1380" tabindex="-1">v1380</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1781
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nit hohfart ν wiplich zorn 1380<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1381" id="v1381" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1381" tabindex="-1">v1381</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1782
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>30 vant an ir neheine stat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1382" id="v1382" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1382" tabindex="-1">v1382</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1783
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wand nie fr5e so hohe getrat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1383" id="v1383" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1383" tabindex="-1">v1383</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1784
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ze soelden y ze eren gliche<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1384" id="v1384" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1384" tabindex="-1">v1384</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1785
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des ist hivte ir lop so riche<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1385" id="v1385" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1385" tabindex="-1">v1385</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1786
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die zuht sie umbegurte 1385<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1386" id="v1386" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1386" tabindex="-1">v1386</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1787
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>flachen y bose antwrte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1387" id="v1387" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1387" tabindex="-1">v1387</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1788
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>muste ir sin unerchant<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1388" id="v1388" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1388" tabindex="-1">v1388</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1789
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sie was ân der sunden bant<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1790
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1791
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1389" id="v1389" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1389" tabindex="-1">v1389</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1792
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uasten oder wachen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1390" id="v1390" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1390" tabindex="-1">v1390</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1793
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz enmahte sie niht gemachen 1390<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1391" id="v1391" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1391" tabindex="-1">v1391</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1794
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>35 misseuar noh trübe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1392" id="v1392" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1392" tabindex="-1">v1392</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1795
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des wnderot genüge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1796
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1797
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1798
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1799
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1800
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1801
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1802
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1803
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1393" id="v1393" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1393" tabindex="-1">v1393</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1804
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>alle ir husgnozinne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1394" id="v1394" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1394" tabindex="-1">v1394</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1805
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die starhte sie in der minne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1806
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1807
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1395" id="v1395" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1395" tabindex="-1">v1395</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1808
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie die ubermüte 1395<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1396" id="v1396" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1396" tabindex="-1">v1396</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1809
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>erslugen mit der gute<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1397" id="v1397" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1397" tabindex="-1">v1397</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1810
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>y allez unreht uermiten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1398" id="v1398" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1398" tabindex="-1">v1398</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1811
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ze also luterlichen siten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1399" id="v1399" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1399" tabindex="-1">v1399</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1812
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>cherte sie diy suzze<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1400" id="v1400" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1400" tabindex="-1">v1400</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1813
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nu bittet sie daz sie uns müzze 1400<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1401" id="v1401" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1401" tabindex="-1">v1401</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1814
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wider cheren uon den sunden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1402" id="v1402" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1402" tabindex="-1">v1402</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1815
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν an ir minne erzunden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1403" id="v1403" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1403" tabindex="-1">v1403</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1816
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Nie wart so wol sprechender man <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1404" id="v1404" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1404" tabindex="-1">v1404</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1817
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der ie uon buchen sin gewan<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1405" id="v1405" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1405" tabindex="-1">v1405</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1818
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ez tohte im einen 1405<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1406" id="v1406" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1406" tabindex="-1">v1406</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1819
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ze sprechen uon der reinen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1407" id="v1407" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1407" tabindex="-1">v1407</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1820
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uollekliche nah ir werdicheit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1408" id="v1408" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1408" tabindex="-1">v1408</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1821
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>an die got sinen fliz leite<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1822
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1823
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1824
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1825
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1826
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1827
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1828
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1829
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1830
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1831
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1832
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1833
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1834
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1409" id="v1409" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1409" tabindex="-1">v1409</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1835
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>als er sie gemaeheln wolte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1410" id="v1410" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1410" tabindex="-1">v1410</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1836
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν bi ir büen scholte 1410<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1837
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1411" id="v1411" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1411" tabindex="-1">v1411</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1838
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>eines sites sie do begunde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1412" id="v1412" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1412" tabindex="-1">v1412</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1839
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den weder wip noh man chunde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1413" id="v1413" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1413" tabindex="-1">v1413</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1840
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>noh uor ir geburte ie uernam<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1414" id="v1414" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1414" tabindex="-1">v1414</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1841
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>swsennez also cham<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1415" id="v1415" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1415" tabindex="-1">v1415</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1842
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie ieman grüzte 1415<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1843
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1416" id="v1416" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1416" tabindex="-1">v1416</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1844
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν sie daz gelten muste<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1417" id="v1417" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1417" tabindex="-1">v1417</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1845
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so gnadet sie got zehant<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1418" id="v1418" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1418" tabindex="-1">v1418</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1846
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der ir heil so hete gewant<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1419" id="v1419" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1419" tabindex="-1">v1419</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1847
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ir div werlte zusprah<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1420" id="v1420" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1420" tabindex="-1">v1420</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1848
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>senftiv wort da sis ansah 1420<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1849
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1850
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1851
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1852
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1853
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1854
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1421" id="v1421" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1421" tabindex="-1">v1421</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1855
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>swa sie aver den gruzsal<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1422" id="v1422" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1422" tabindex="-1">v1422</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1856
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sholte bieten uberai<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1423" id="v1423" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1423" tabindex="-1">v1423</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1857
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sie bat herzeklichen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1424" id="v1424" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1424" tabindex="-1">v1424</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1858
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie got gnadeklichen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1425" id="v1425" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1425" tabindex="-1">v1425</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1859
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>an der rede meinte 1425<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1860
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1861
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1426" id="v1426" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1426" tabindex="-1">v1426</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1862
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν güten abent bescheinte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1427" id="v1427" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1427" tabindex="-1">v1427</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1863
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>oder sseligen morgen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1428" id="v1428" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1428" tabindex="-1">v1428</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1864
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den livten die mit sorgen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1429" id="v1429" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1429" tabindex="-1">v1429</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1865
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in der werlte buwent<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1430" id="v1430" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1430" tabindex="-1">v1430</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1866
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vñ im iedoh getruwent 1430<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1431" id="v1431" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1431" tabindex="-1">v1431</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1867
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>danne chom uns div gewonheit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1432" id="v1432" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1432" tabindex="-1">v1432</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1868
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz wir bediv liep vnd leit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1433" id="v1433" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1433" tabindex="-1">v1433</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1869
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uf sin gnade shuln ergeben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1434" id="v1434" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1434" tabindex="-1">v1434</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1870
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uon dem wir han daz leben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1435" id="v1435" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1435" tabindex="-1">v1435</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1871
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>gelernet wir han dabi 1435<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1436" id="v1436" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1436" tabindex="-1">v1436</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1872
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>swer so uns gruzende si<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1437" id="v1437" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1437" tabindex="-1">v1437</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1873
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz wir im also schone<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1438" id="v1438" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1438" tabindex="-1">v1438</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1874
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wnsken daz gotes lone<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1875
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1439" id="v1439" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1439" tabindex="-1">v1439</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1876
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vnt dem irdiskem schine<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1440" id="v1440" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1440" tabindex="-1">v1440</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1877
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der eren uercihen 1440<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1441" id="v1441" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1441" tabindex="-1">v1441</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1878
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>si diente got ane wanch<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1879
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1880
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1881
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1442" id="v1442" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1442" tabindex="-1">v1442</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1882
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν hete einen gedanch<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1443" id="v1443" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1443" tabindex="-1">v1443</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1883
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ob sie ze vil redet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1444" id="v1444" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1444" tabindex="-1">v1444</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1884
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ez lihte ir scoedet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1445" id="v1445" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1445" tabindex="-1">v1445</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1885
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>20 ν daz sie uor urspricÄ 1445<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1446" id="v1446" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1446" tabindex="-1">v1446</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1886
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>an ir mûte verwandelt sich<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1447" id="v1447" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1447" tabindex="-1">v1447</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1887
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>iz en waere uil nutze<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1888
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1448" id="v1448" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1448" tabindex="-1">v1448</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1889
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sie liez ir anlutze<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1449" id="v1449" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1449" tabindex="-1">v1449</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1890
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vil selten erlachen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1450" id="v1450" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1450" tabindex="-1">v1450</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1891
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>man iah ir an allen sachen 1450<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1451" id="v1451" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1451" tabindex="-1">v1451</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1892
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ie der tugende besten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1452" id="v1452" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1452" tabindex="-1">v1452</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1893
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die begunden oh esten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1453" id="v1453" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1453" tabindex="-1">v1453</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1894
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν vil witen umbe vahen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1454" id="v1454" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1454" tabindex="-1">v1454</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1895
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di siechen die sie ersahen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1455" id="v1455" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1455" tabindex="-1">v1455</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1896
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>25 ν sie angerurten 1455<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1897
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1898
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1899
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1900
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1901
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1902
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1903
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1904
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1905
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1456" id="v1456" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1456" tabindex="-1">v1456</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1906
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die chraft sie danne fvrten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1907
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1457" id="v1457" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1457" tabindex="-1">v1457</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1908
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie niht mere swar<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1458" id="v1458" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1458" tabindex="-1">v1458</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1909
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>darumbe cherten si dar<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1459" id="v1459" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1459" tabindex="-1">v1459</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1910
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wand sie da gnade funden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1460" id="v1460" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1460" tabindex="-1">v1460</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1911
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nu ruche sie unser wnden 1460<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1461" id="v1461" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1461" tabindex="-1">v1461</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1912
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>bedeken mit ir gute<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1462" id="v1462" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1462" tabindex="-1">v1462</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1913
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz wir uzer gotes hüte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1463" id="v1463" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1463" tabindex="-1">v1463</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1914
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>iemer komen so uerre<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1464" id="v1464" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1464" tabindex="-1">v1464</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1915
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz uns des tiefils gwalt iht werre<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1916
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1917
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1918
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1919
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1920
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1921
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1922
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1923
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1924
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1925
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1926
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1465" id="v1465" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1465" tabindex="-1">v1465</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1927
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Do sie wahsen begunde 1465<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1466" id="v1466" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1466" tabindex="-1">v1466</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1928
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do wart sie in kurcer stunde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1467" id="v1467" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1467" tabindex="-1">v1467</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1929
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>an dem hare ν an der lich<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1468" id="v1468" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1468" tabindex="-1">v1468</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1930
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>über elliv wip so wsetlich<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1931
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1932
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1933
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1469" id="v1469" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1469" tabindex="-1">v1469</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1934
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ein herre hiez Abiathar<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1470" id="v1470" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1470" tabindex="-1">v1470</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1935
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der wante sinen mut dar 1470<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1471" id="v1471" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1471" tabindex="-1">v1471</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1936
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wie er die maget gwnne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1472" id="v1472" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1472" tabindex="-1">v1472</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1937
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sinem lieben svn ze wnne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1938
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1473" id="v1473" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1473" tabindex="-1">v1473</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1939
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der vil kindiske man<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1474" id="v1474" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1474" tabindex="-1">v1474</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1940
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der was oh ir gnozsam<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1475" id="v1475" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1475" tabindex="-1">v1475</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1941
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der herliche degen 1475<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1476" id="v1476" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1476" tabindex="-1">v1476</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1942
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>gerte sie mit bete erwegen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1477" id="v1477" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1477" tabindex="-1">v1477</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1943
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie in ruchte minnen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1944
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1945
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1478" id="v1478" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1478" tabindex="-1">v1478</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1946
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>durh erben gedingen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1479" id="v1479" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1479" tabindex="-1">v1479</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1947
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der e hete er hinz ir gedaht<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1480" id="v1480" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1480" tabindex="-1">v1480</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1948
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>doh wart div rede niht volbraht 1480<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1481" id="v1481" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1481" tabindex="-1">v1481</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1949
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wand div froe des niht uerdolte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1482" id="v1482" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1482" tabindex="-1">v1482</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1950
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sie sprah daz sie nien wolte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1483" id="v1483" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1483" tabindex="-1">v1483</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1951
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>iemer man geruren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1484" id="v1484" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1484" tabindex="-1">v1484</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1952
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz werltliche ungefure<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1485" id="v1485" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1485" tabindex="-1">v1485</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1953
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>duhte sie so chumberriche 1485<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1486" id="v1486" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1486" tabindex="-1">v1486</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1954
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie gerne friliche<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1955
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1487" id="v1487" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1487" tabindex="-1">v1487</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1956
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>lebet ane mannes gebende<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1488" id="v1488" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1488" tabindex="-1">v1488</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1957
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'u''ntze an des libes ende'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1489" id="v1489" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1489" tabindex="-1">v1489</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1958
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>got einen hsete sie erweit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1490" id="v1490" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1490" tabindex="-1">v1490</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1959
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>dem si lip mit sele seit 1490<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1491" id="v1491" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1491" tabindex="-1">v1491</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1960
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie wäre sin div ν sin brit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1492" id="v1492" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1492" tabindex="-1">v1492</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1961
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er bediv ir herre ν ir trût<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1493" id="v1493" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1493" tabindex="-1">v1493</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1962
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div antwrte was ungemah<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1494" id="v1494" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1494" tabindex="-1">v1494</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1963
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>dem bittel vnde gesprah<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1495" id="v1495" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1495" tabindex="-1">v1495</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1964
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>alle sin genozze 1495<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1496" id="v1496" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1496" tabindex="-1">v1496</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1965
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er bot in míete groze<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1497" id="v1497" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1497" tabindex="-1">v1497</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1966
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die des tempels pflagen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1498" id="v1498" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1498" tabindex="-1">v1498</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1967
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie niht schölte betragen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1499" id="v1499" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1499" tabindex="-1">v1499</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1968
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sie Ii semen die maget gute<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1500" id="v1500" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1500" tabindex="-1">v1500</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1969
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uon dem swserem mûte 1500<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1501" id="v1501" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1501" tabindex="-1">v1501</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1970
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den sie ir habte furgesat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1502" id="v1502" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1502" tabindex="-1">v1502</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1971
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>darumbe gehiez er ν bat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1972
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1973
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1974
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1975
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1503" id="v1503" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1503" tabindex="-1">v1503</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1976
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er bot in golt daz rote<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1504" id="v1504" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1504" tabindex="-1">v1504</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1977
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>unt dingete vil gnote<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1505" id="v1505" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1505" tabindex="-1">v1505</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1978
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit dem silber wizze 1505<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1506" id="v1506" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1506" tabindex="-1">v1506</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1979
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie im hülfen mit flizze<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1507" id="v1507" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1507" tabindex="-1">v1507</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1980
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>umbe daz kint des er gert<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1508" id="v1508" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1508" tabindex="-1">v1508</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1981
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ir sin sun wrde gewert<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1509" id="v1509" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1509" tabindex="-1">v1509</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1982
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nah rehte ze elichen dingen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1510" id="v1510" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1510" tabindex="-1">v1510</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1983
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div miete began in gelingen 1510<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1984
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1985
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1986
