         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1995
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz div fröe tsète<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1514" id="v1514" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1514" tabindex="-1">v1514</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1996
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>swes sie der herre baete<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1515" id="v1515" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1515" tabindex="-1">v1515</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1997
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Do sprah soente Marie 1515<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1516" id="v1516" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1516" tabindex="-1">v1516</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1998
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>got hete erzundet sie<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1517" id="v1517" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1517" tabindex="-1">v1517</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v1999
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
