         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2013
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ze werltliker minne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1523" id="v1523" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1523" tabindex="-1">v1523</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2014
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ir ne schult mih niht reizzen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1524" id="v1524" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1524" tabindex="-1">v1524</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2015
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ia han ich got entheizzen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1525" id="v1525" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1525" tabindex="-1">v1525</a>
