         </span>der was sin flizich durh den gewin 1530<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1531" id="v1531" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1531" tabindex="-1">v1531</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2022
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er sprak froe la die rede stan<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1532" id="v1532" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1532" tabindex="-1">v1532</a>
