         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2049
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wan dir got sinen segen git<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1549" id="v1549" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1549" tabindex="-1">v1549</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2050
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν fròde mit lieben kinden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1550" id="v1550" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1550" tabindex="-1">v1550</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2051
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>an den soltu heil vinden 1550<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1551" id="v1551" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1551" tabindex="-1">v1551</a>
