         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2125
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sie füren als sie tobeten 1605<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1606" id="v1606" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1606" tabindex="-1">v1606</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2126
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ein teidinch sie gelobeten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1607" id="v1607" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1607" tabindex="-1">v1607</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2127
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>25 sie gebutten ein gesende<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1608" id="v1608" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1608" tabindex="-1">v1608</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2128
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie chomen -an ein ende<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2129
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2130
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2131
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1609" id="v1609" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1609" tabindex="-1">v1609</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2132
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ob Maria die msere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1610" id="v1610" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1610" tabindex="-1">v1610</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2133
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so ungeuolgich wäre 1610<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1611" id="v1611" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1611" tabindex="-1">v1611</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2134
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der gesprochen tach<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1612" id="v1612" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1612" tabindex="-1">v1612</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2135
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>an einer hohzite gelach<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1613" id="v1613" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1613" tabindex="-1">v1613</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2136
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do chom michel menige dar<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1614" id="v1614" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1614" tabindex="-1">v1614</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2137
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der bisgof hiez Abiathar<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1615" id="v1615" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1615" tabindex="-1">v1615</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2138
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der gruzte sie an der borte 1615<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1616" id="v1616" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1616" tabindex="-1">v1616</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2139
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit dem gotes worte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1617" id="v1617" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1617" tabindex="-1">v1617</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2140
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>30 er stunt uf eine grede<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1618" id="v1618" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1618" tabindex="-1">v1618</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2141
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν hub uf sin hende bede<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1619" id="v1619" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1619" tabindex="-1">v1619</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2142
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>gegen dem himelisken sal<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1620" id="v1620" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1620" tabindex="-1">v1620</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2143
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>eine stille gebot er über al 1620<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1621" id="v1621" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1621" tabindex="-1">v1621</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2144
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er sprah nu höret alle<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1622" id="v1622" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1622" tabindex="-1">v1622</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2145
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wie iv daz geualle<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1623" id="v1623" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1623" tabindex="-1">v1623</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2146
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz Maria div schone tut<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1624" id="v1624" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1624" tabindex="-1">v1624</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2147
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>niemen ist so edel noh so gut<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1625" id="v1625" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1625" tabindex="-1">v1625</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2148
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so riche noh so tîvre 1625<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1626" id="v1626" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1626" tabindex="-1">v1626</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2149
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz er ir gezem hîvre<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2150
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1627" id="v1627" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1627" tabindex="-1">v1627</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2151
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>swer ir ze wibe gert<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1628" id="v1628" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1628" tabindex="-1">v1628</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2152
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der scheidet dannen ungewert<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2153
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1629" id="v1629" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1629" tabindex="-1">v1629</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2154
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sine trvet niht genesen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1630" id="v1630" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1630" tabindex="-1">v1630</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2155
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sine muzze maget wesen 1630<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1631" id="v1631" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1631" tabindex="-1">v1631</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2156
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wir haben fròeii vil gezogen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1632" id="v1632" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1632" tabindex="-1">v1632</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2157
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>kunige tohter ν herzogen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1633" id="v1633" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1633" tabindex="-1">v1633</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2158
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der herlichen slahte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1634" id="v1634" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1634" tabindex="-1">v1634</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2159
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz uns nie dehewiiv in der ahte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1635" id="v1635" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1635" tabindex="-1">v1635</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2160
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>also vil ie gemûte 1635<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1636" id="v1636" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1636" tabindex="-1">v1636</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2161
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und iedoh vil grozer gûte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1637" id="v1637" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1637" tabindex="-1">v1637</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2162
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ze rede waren worden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1638" id="v1638" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1638" tabindex="-1">v1638</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2163
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uon allen ir uordern<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1639" id="v1639" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1639" tabindex="-1">v1639</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2164
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>deist ein michel herte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1640" id="v1640" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1640" tabindex="-1">v1640</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2165
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des guten Aaronis gerte 1640<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1641" id="v1641" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1641" tabindex="-1">v1641</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2166
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der man ih alle dise diet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2167
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2168
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2169
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1642" id="v1642" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1642" tabindex="-1">v1642</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2170
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wie er den grozen strit schiet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1643" id="v1643" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1643" tabindex="-1">v1643</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2171
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do die gotes ewarte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1644" id="v1644" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1644" tabindex="-1">v1644</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2172
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>under in zewrfen harte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1645" id="v1645" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1645" tabindex="-1">v1645</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2173
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div gerte wart wider grûen 1645<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1646" id="v1646" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1646" tabindex="-1">v1646</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2174
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>begunde löben ν bit en<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1647" id="v1647" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1647" tabindex="-1">v1647</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2175
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in der heiligen arche<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2176
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2177
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2178
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1648" id="v1648" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1648" tabindex="-1">v1648</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2179
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>got der mak noh sam starche<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1649" id="v1649" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1649" tabindex="-1">v1649</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2180
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>siniv tögen erzseigen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1650" id="v1650" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1650" tabindex="-1">v1650</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2181
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div werlt ist sin aeîgen 1650<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1651" id="v1651" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1651" tabindex="-1">v1651</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2182
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der menniske sin hantgetât<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1652" id="v1652" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1652" tabindex="-1">v1652</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2183
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>an im reht ν gnade stat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1653" id="v1653" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1653" tabindex="-1">v1653</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2184
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz bedenchet alle wol<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1654" id="v1654" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1654" tabindex="-1">v1654</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2185
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ih sage iv wie nu tvn schol<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1655" id="v1655" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1655" tabindex="-1">v1655</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2186
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>disiv menige algemeine 1655<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1656" id="v1656" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1656" tabindex="-1">v1656</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2187
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz got die warheit bescheine<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1657" id="v1657" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1657" tabindex="-1">v1657</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2188
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν sinen willen dabi<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1658" id="v1658" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1658" tabindex="-1">v1658</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2189
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die von elichem bande vri<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1659" id="v1659" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1659" tabindex="-1">v1659</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2190
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sin komen an den tac hivte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1660" id="v1660" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1660" tabindex="-1">v1660</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2191
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der ieglicher uor dem livte 1660<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1661" id="v1661" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1661" tabindex="-1">v1661</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2192
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>bringe morgen sin gerte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2193
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2194
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2195
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2196
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2197
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2198
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2199
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2200
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1662" id="v1662" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1662" tabindex="-1">v1662</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2201
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der got der sie gwerte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1663" id="v1663" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1663" tabindex="-1">v1663</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2202
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>bi Aaronis ziten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1664" id="v1664" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1664" tabindex="-1">v1664</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2203
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nu wir siner gnaden biten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1665" id="v1665" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1665" tabindex="-1">v1665</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2204
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der lazze uns werden schin 1665<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1666" id="v1666" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1666" tabindex="-1">v1666</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2205
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wes Maria brvt schul sin<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1667" id="v1667" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1667" tabindex="-1">v1667</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2206
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>15 ν erzseige mit gewalte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1668" id="v1668" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1668" tabindex="-1">v1668</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2207
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'Aver ir von siner gebe walte'''<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2208
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2209
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1669" id="v1669" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1669" tabindex="-1">v1669</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2210
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Michel wart do der schal<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1670" id="v1670" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1670" tabindex="-1">v1670</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2211
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der rat gevìel in vber al 1670<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1671" id="v1671" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1671" tabindex="-1">v1671</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2212
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do iahen sie gemseinliche<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1672" id="v1672" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1672" tabindex="-1">v1672</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2213
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div rede wière lobliche<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1673" id="v1673" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1673" tabindex="-1">v1673</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2214
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sie behielten gerne sin gebot<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1674" id="v1674" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1674" tabindex="-1">v1674</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2215
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν dingoten hinze got<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1675" id="v1675" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1675" tabindex="-1">v1675</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2216
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die da waren ungehit 1675<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1676" id="v1676" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1676" tabindex="-1">v1676</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2217
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz er schiede selbe den strit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2218
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2219
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1677" id="v1677" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1677" tabindex="-1">v1677</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2220
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>20 div naht duhte sie zelanch<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1678" id="v1678" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1678" tabindex="-1">v1678</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2221
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν heten mangen gedanch<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1679" id="v1679" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1679" tabindex="-1">v1679</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2222
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vmbe die maget wolgetan<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1680" id="v1680" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1680" tabindex="-1">v1680</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2223
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wer sie ze wibe solté han 1680<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1681" id="v1681" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1681" tabindex="-1">v1681</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2224
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wand sie al der werlte behagete<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2225
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1682" id="v1682" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1682" tabindex="-1">v1682</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2226
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do ez des morgens tagete<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1683" id="v1683" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1683" tabindex="-1">v1683</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2227
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der bisgof nam dehem friste<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1684" id="v1684" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1684" tabindex="-1">v1684</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2228
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er chom ze uorderiste<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1685" id="v1685" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1685" tabindex="-1">v1685</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2229
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die riehen ν die iungen 1685<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1686" id="v1686" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1686" tabindex="-1">v1686</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2230
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uaste zu im drungen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1687" id="v1687" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1687" tabindex="-1">v1687</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2231
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>25 wol gebadet wol gechleit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1688" id="v1688" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1688" tabindex="-1">v1688</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2232
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>als daz ware liei seit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1689" id="v1689" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1689" tabindex="-1">v1689</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2233
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>grozlich was ir geuerte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2234
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2235
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2236
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2237
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2238
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2239
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1690" id="v1690" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1690" tabindex="-1">v1690</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2240
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sie brahten schone gerte 1690<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1691" id="v1691" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1691" tabindex="-1">v1691</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2241
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>lange vnde slehte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1692" id="v1692" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1692" tabindex="-1">v1692</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2242
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do marhte vil rehte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1693" id="v1693" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1693" tabindex="-1">v1693</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2243
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>aller mannekliche die sine<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1694" id="v1694" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1694" tabindex="-1">v1694</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2244
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν wante der magede gewert sin<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2245
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1695" id="v1695" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1695" tabindex="-1">v1695</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2246
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ir ieglicher hetes wan 1695<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1696" id="v1696" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1696" tabindex="-1">v1696</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2247
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>doh solt ez anders ergan<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2248
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2249
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2250
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1697" id="v1697" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1697" tabindex="-1">v1697</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2251
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die armen umbesaezen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1698" id="v1698" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1698" tabindex="-1">v1698</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2252
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die getorsten niht uerlazzen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1699" id="v1699" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1699" tabindex="-1">v1699</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2253
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die ledigiv livte waren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1700" id="v1700" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1700" tabindex="-1">v1700</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2254
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sine musen gebaren 1700<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1701" id="v1701" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1701" tabindex="-1">v1701</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2255
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>als man in von hove gebot<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1702" id="v1702" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1702" tabindex="-1">v1702</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2256
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do kom durh die selben not<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1703" id="v1703" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1703" tabindex="-1">v1703</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2257
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uf den tach ein grise man<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2258
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2259
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1704" id="v1704" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1704" tabindex="-1">v1704</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2260
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so harte forhte er den ban<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1705" id="v1705" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1705" tabindex="-1">v1705</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2261
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Ioseph was er genant 1705<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1706" id="v1706" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1706" tabindex="-1">v1706</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2262
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der ist uns ob wol erchant<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1707" id="v1707" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1707" tabindex="-1">v1707</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2263
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>16835 so wir an den büchen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1708" id="v1708" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1708" tabindex="-1">v1708</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2264
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sinen namen wellen suchen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1709" id="v1709" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1709" tabindex="-1">v1709</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2265
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der was ein witewafere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1710" id="v1710" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1710" tabindex="-1">v1710</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2266
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>alter gut ν gewsere 1710<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2267
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1711" id="v1711" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1711" tabindex="-1">v1711</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2268
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>brode sines libes<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1712" id="v1712" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1712" tabindex="-1">v1712</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2269
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der engerte niht wibes<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1713" id="v1713" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1713" tabindex="-1">v1713</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2270
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er braht ein chleinez gertelin<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1714" id="v1714" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1714" tabindex="-1">v1714</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2271
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>durh die gehorsam sin<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1715" id="v1715" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1715" tabindex="-1">v1715</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2272
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ris also churze 1715<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1716" id="v1716" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1716" tabindex="-1">v1716</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2273
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz het er ab der wrze<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1717" id="v1717" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1717" tabindex="-1">v1717</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2274
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>gecerret harte unwaehe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1718" id="v1718" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1718" tabindex="-1">v1718</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2275
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz div werlt dabi s sehe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1719" id="v1719" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1719" tabindex="-1">v1719</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2276
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sin gemute niene stan<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1720" id="v1720" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1720" tabindex="-1">v1720</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2277
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nah fro den noh vf liebes wan 1720<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1721" id="v1721" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1721" tabindex="-1">v1721</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2278
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die gerte gaben sie zehofe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1722" id="v1722" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1722" tabindex="-1">v1722</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2279
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die enphiench der bisgof<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2280
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2281
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2282
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2283
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2284
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2285
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2286
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2287
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1723" id="v1723" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1723" tabindex="-1">v1723</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2288
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν garte sih in die heren wât<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1724" id="v1724" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1724" tabindex="-1">v1724</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2289
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ze himele suhter den rat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1725" id="v1725" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1725" tabindex="-1">v1725</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2290
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do giench er also schone 1725<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1726" id="v1726" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1726" tabindex="-1">v1726</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2291
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>zu dem tische frone<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1727" id="v1727" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1727" tabindex="-1">v1727</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2292
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz er da erfunde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1728" id="v1728" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1728" tabindex="-1">v1728</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2293
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so er uerriste chunde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1729" id="v1729" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1729" tabindex="-1">v1729</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2294
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ob dem altaere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1730" id="v1730" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1730" tabindex="-1">v1730</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2295
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>waz gotes wille waere 1730<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2296
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1731" id="v1731" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1731" tabindex="-1">v1731</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2297
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Nu uernemet alle besunder<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1732" id="v1732" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1732" tabindex="-1">v1732</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2298
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div manchvaltigen wnder<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1733" id="v1733" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1733" tabindex="-1">v1733</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2299
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div got der diete zeiget<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1734" id="v1734" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1734" tabindex="-1">v1734</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2300
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div ir gemvte naeiget<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1735" id="v1735" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1735" tabindex="-1">v1735</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2301
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>under sine mseisterschaft 1735<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1736" id="v1736" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1736" tabindex="-1">v1736</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2302
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do der bisgof vor der lantschaft<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1737" id="v1737" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1737" tabindex="-1">v1737</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2303
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ze himele hub sine hende<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1738" id="v1738" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1738" tabindex="-1">v1738</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2304
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do nam ez gut ende<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2305
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1739" id="v1739" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1739" tabindex="-1">v1739</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2306
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit zaeheren was er begozzen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1740" id="v1740" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1740" tabindex="-1">v1740</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2307
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sin herze wol beslozzen 1740<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1741" id="v1741" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1741" tabindex="-1">v1741</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2308
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in der waren minne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1742" id="v1742" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1742" tabindex="-1">v1742</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2309
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do chom div gotis stimme<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1743" id="v1743" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1743" tabindex="-1">v1743</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2310
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sie sprah ih wil dih gewern<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1744" id="v1744" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1744" tabindex="-1">v1744</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2311
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν δ li dise menige niht entwern<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2312
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2313
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2314
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2315
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1745" id="v1745" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1745" tabindex="-1">v1745</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2316
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des sie mih gebeten hat· 1745<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1746" id="v1746" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1746" tabindex="-1">v1746</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2317
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mir ist geliehen din rat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1747" id="v1747" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1747" tabindex="-1">v1747</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2318
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mi hab daz in diner ahte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1748" id="v1748" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1748" tabindex="-1">v1748</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2319
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz dv die gerten hinaht<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1749" id="v1749" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1749" tabindex="-1">v1749</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2320
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>zu dem heilctum rvwen legest<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1750" id="v1750" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1750" tabindex="-1">v1750</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2321
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>unt sie morgen wider gebest  1750<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1751" id="v1751" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1751" tabindex="-1">v1751</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2322
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so zseige ih iv den man so guten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2323
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2324
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2325
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2326
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2327
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2328
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2329
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2330
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1752" id="v1752" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1752" tabindex="-1">v1752</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2331
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der Mariani scoi behüten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1753" id="v1753" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1753" tabindex="-1">v1753</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2332
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>dem ih die ere han beschert<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2333
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1754" id="v1754" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1754" tabindex="-1">v1754</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2334
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ein tube uon sinem stabe vert<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1755" id="v1755" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1755" tabindex="-1">v1755</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2335
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div heuet sih ze der grufte 1755<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1756" id="v1756" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1756" tabindex="-1">v1756</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2336
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vnd swinget sih in die lüfte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1757" id="v1757" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1757" tabindex="-1">v1757</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2337
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie niemen mak gesehen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1758" id="v1758" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1758" tabindex="-1">v1758</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2338
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>dem schult ir alle des iehen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1759" id="v1759" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1759" tabindex="-1">v1759</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2339
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz er die maget suzze<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1760" id="v1760" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1760" tabindex="-1">v1760</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2340
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uor iv gemaheln muzze 1760<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1761" id="v1761" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1761" tabindex="-1">v1761</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2341
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sage du dem lîvte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1762" id="v1762" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1762" tabindex="-1">v1762</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2342
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'daz ih daz wil ν gebivte'''<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1763" id="v1763" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1763" tabindex="-1">v1763</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2343
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Nu rveget ivh alle damite<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1764" id="v1764" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1764" tabindex="-1">v1764</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2344
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz got die svntigen site<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1765" id="v1765" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1765" tabindex="-1">v1765</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2345
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>an uns so harte schivhet 1765<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1766" id="v1766" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1766" tabindex="-1">v1766</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2346
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz uns sin stimme flivhet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1767" id="v1767" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1767" tabindex="-1">v1767</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2347
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div unser uordern ofte erschein<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1768" id="v1768" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1768" tabindex="-1">v1768</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2348
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wan des ist zwiuel nehein<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1769" id="v1769" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1769" tabindex="-1">v1769</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2349
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do uon dem bisgofe here<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1770" id="v1770" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1770" tabindex="-1">v1770</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2350
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>eroöent wart div lere 1770<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1771" id="v1771" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1771" tabindex="-1">v1771</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2351
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die er got mit diemut angwan<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1772" id="v1772" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1772" tabindex="-1">v1772</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2352
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do fròet sih wip ν man<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2353
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2354
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1773" id="v1773" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1773" tabindex="-1">v1773</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2355
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vnd als der morgenrot<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1774" id="v1774" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1774" tabindex="-1">v1774</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2356
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der vinstirn erde lieht erbot<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1775" id="v1775" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1775" tabindex="-1">v1775</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2357
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz al div werlte erluhte 1775<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1776" id="v1776" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1776" tabindex="-1">v1776</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2358
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die menige do zit duhte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1777" id="v1777" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1777" tabindex="-1">v1777</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2359
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie ze hone giengen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1778" id="v1778" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1778" tabindex="-1">v1778</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2360
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ir gerte wider enpfiengen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1779" id="v1779" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1779" tabindex="-1">v1779</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2361
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ze eriste gap man den riehen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1780" id="v1780" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1780" tabindex="-1">v1780</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2362
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den der arme mñzze entwichen1780<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1781" id="v1781" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1781" tabindex="-1">v1781</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2363
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν darnah den smoehen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1782" id="v1782" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1782" tabindex="-1">v1782</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2364
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sie sprachen swa sie s sehen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1783" id="v1783" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1783" tabindex="-1">v1783</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2365
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz zeichen mit den ogen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1784" id="v1784" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1784" tabindex="-1">v1784</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2366
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz wolten sie globen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2367
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2368
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1785" id="v1785" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1785" tabindex="-1">v1785</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2369
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Iosebes gerte div chleine 1785<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1786" id="v1786" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1786" tabindex="-1">v1786</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2370
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>diT was ueruallen eine<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1787" id="v1787" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1787" tabindex="-1">v1787</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2371
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uon den andern sie gesleif<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1788" id="v1788" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1788" tabindex="-1">v1788</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2372
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie der bisgof niht begreif<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1789" id="v1789" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1789" tabindex="-1">v1789</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2373
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do wanten sie algemêine<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1790" id="v1790" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1790" tabindex="-1">v1790</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2374
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ητ in daz zeichen niht erscheine 1790<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1791" id="v1791" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1791" tabindex="-1">v1791</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2375
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ez chôme uon ir sunden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1792" id="v1792" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1792" tabindex="-1">v1792</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2376
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz got waere erwnden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1793" id="v1793" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1793" tabindex="-1">v1793</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2377
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>siner grozen barmunge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1794" id="v1794" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1794" tabindex="-1">v1794</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2378
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sie wanten herze τ zunge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1795" id="v1795" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1795" tabindex="-1">v1795</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2379
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>dimutekliche an in 1795<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1796" id="v1796" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1796" tabindex="-1">v1796</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2380
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz in diT tube erschin<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1797" id="v1797" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1797" tabindex="-1">v1797</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2381
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div in da was geheizen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1798" id="v1798" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1798" tabindex="-1">v1798</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2382
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sie rowe daz sie gemeizzen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1799" id="v1799" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1799" tabindex="-1">v1799</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2383
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die schonen gerte heeten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1800" id="v1800" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1800" tabindex="-1">v1800</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2384
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nu ruche er sie beraten 1800<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1801" id="v1801" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1801" tabindex="-1">v1801</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2385
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der al die Werlte wiset<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1802" id="v1802" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1802" tabindex="-1">v1802</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2386
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Tnt sîn warheit briset<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1803" id="v1803" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1803" tabindex="-1">v1803</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2387
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit rehte ν mit gûte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1804" id="v1804" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1804" tabindex="-1">v1804</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2388
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der gefroe ir gemute<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1805" id="v1805" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1805" tabindex="-1">v1805</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2389
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ia erschameten sih di fursten 1805<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1806" id="v1806" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1806" tabindex="-1">v1806</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2390
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der frauel daz sie getorsten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2391
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1807" id="v1807" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1807" tabindex="-1">v1807</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2392
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>dar gebieten ir gerte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1808" id="v1808" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1808" tabindex="-1">v1808</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2393
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>si erkanten ir herte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1809" id="v1809" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1809" tabindex="-1">v1809</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2394
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>τ chlagten ir missetat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1810" id="v1810" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1810" tabindex="-1">v1810</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2395
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie in hohfertiger wat 1810<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1811" id="v1811" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1811" tabindex="-1">v1811</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2396
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>gotes togen wolten sehen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1812" id="v1812" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1812" tabindex="-1">v1812</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2397
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz mit diemut müz geschehen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2398
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2399
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2400
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2401
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1813" id="v1813" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1813" tabindex="-1">v1813</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2402
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Iosep der gotes trut<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1814" id="v1814" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1814" tabindex="-1">v1814</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2403
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der floh die rede Tnt die brut<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1815" id="v1815" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1815" tabindex="-1">v1815</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2404
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er duhte sih so nidere 1815<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1816" id="v1816" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1816" tabindex="-1">v1816</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2405
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz er nîen wolte widere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1817" id="v1817" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1817" tabindex="-1">v1817</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2406
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sin klein gerte enpfahen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1818" id="v1818" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1818" tabindex="-1">v1818</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2407
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do si do niht ensahen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1819" id="v1819" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1819" tabindex="-1">v1819</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2408
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sie sprachen mit einem mvnde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1820" id="v1820" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1820" tabindex="-1">v1820</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2409
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wir schuln des himels urchunde 1820<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1821" id="v1821" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1821" tabindex="-1">v1821</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2410
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>noh herzeklicher suchen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1822" id="v1822" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1822" tabindex="-1">v1822</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2411
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ob des got welle ruchen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1823" id="v1823" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1823" tabindex="-1">v1823</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2412
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz wir gesehen siniv togen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1824" id="v1824" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1824" tabindex="-1">v1824</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2413
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'er ist gnadich deist ynlovgen'''<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2414
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2415
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1825" id="v1825" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1825" tabindex="-1">v1825</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2416
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Abiathar der bisgof 1825<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1826" id="v1826" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1826" tabindex="-1">v1826</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2417
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der hiez do uf den fritbof<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1827" id="v1827" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1827" tabindex="-1">v1827</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2418
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>15 alle die menige entwichen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1828" id="v1828" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1828" tabindex="-1">v1828</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2419
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν betten inneklichen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2420
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2421
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2422
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2423
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1829" id="v1829" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1829" tabindex="-1">v1829</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2424
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ein gienger in den sal<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1830" id="v1830" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1830" tabindex="-1">v1830</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2425
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz livt stunt hievor uberai 1830<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2426
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1831" id="v1831" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1831" tabindex="-1">v1831</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2427
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>selbe gart er sih sa<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1832" id="v1832" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1832" tabindex="-1">v1832</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2428
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in zwelf tintinnabula<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1833" id="v1833" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1833" tabindex="-1">v1833</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2429
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν in die heiligen wat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1834" id="v1834" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1834" tabindex="-1">v1834</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2430
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die Moyses gebrvefet hat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1835" id="v1835" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1835" tabindex="-1">v1835</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2431
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>niht uon mennisken sinne 1835<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1836" id="v1836" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1836" tabindex="-1">v1836</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2432
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wan als im div gotes minne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1837" id="v1837" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1837" tabindex="-1">v1837</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2433
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>gebot ν uorgetihte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1838" id="v1838" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1838" tabindex="-1">v1838</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2434
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>als sih der herre berihte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1839" id="v1839" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1839" tabindex="-1">v1839</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2435
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>got ze flegen in dem gwante<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1840" id="v1840" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1840" tabindex="-1">v1840</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2436
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>erweite mirren er brante 1840<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1841" id="v1841" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1841" tabindex="-1">v1841</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2437
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>tymiama ν wiroh<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1842" id="v1842" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1842" tabindex="-1">v1842</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2438
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sin sunde wêinter oh<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1843" id="v1843" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1843" tabindex="-1">v1843</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2439
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so heize uor dem altsere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1844" id="v1844" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1844" tabindex="-1">v1844</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2440
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz des himels rihtare<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1845" id="v1845" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1845" tabindex="-1">v1845</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2441
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>geruhte bewisen in 1845<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1846" id="v1846" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1846" tabindex="-1">v1846</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2442
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der bediv gnade unde sin<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1847" id="v1847" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1847" tabindex="-1">v1847</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2443
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>25 al der werlte teilet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1848" id="v1848" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1848" tabindex="-1">v1848</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2444
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν die sundare heilet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1849" id="v1849" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1849" tabindex="-1">v1849</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2445
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>swa er die rivwe gesiht<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1850" id="v1850" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1850" tabindex="-1">v1850</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2446
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wand im der barmunge giht 1850<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1851" id="v1851" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1851" tabindex="-1">v1851</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2447
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ensamet himel ν erde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1852" id="v1852" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1852" tabindex="-1">v1852</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2448
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν dienent im so werde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2449
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2450
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2451
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2452
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1853" id="v1853" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1853" tabindex="-1">v1853</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2453
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Do chom ein engel geflogen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1854" id="v1854" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1854" tabindex="-1">v1854</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2454
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ersprah iabirt ir niht betrogen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1855" id="v1855" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1855" tabindex="-1">v1855</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2455
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>got enwandelt niht siniv wort 1855<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1856" id="v1856" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1856" tabindex="-1">v1856</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2456
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nu svche ein chleine gerte dort<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1857" id="v1857" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1857" tabindex="-1">v1857</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2457
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div dir ist enpfallen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1858" id="v1858" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1858" tabindex="-1">v1858</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2458
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div chumet ze frôden in allen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1859" id="v1859" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1859" tabindex="-1">v1859</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2459
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>swie harte sie iv nersmahet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1860" id="v1860" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1860" tabindex="-1">v1860</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2460
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>als sie Iosep enpfahet 1860<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1861" id="v1861" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1861" tabindex="-1">v1861</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2461
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ir geseht div gotes togen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1862" id="v1862" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1862" tabindex="-1">v1862</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2462
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'mit fleisklichen 5gen'''<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2463
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2464
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2465
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1863" id="v1863" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1863" tabindex="-1">v1863</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2466
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Do er die chleinen rute<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1864" id="v1864" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1864" tabindex="-1">v1864</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2467
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>allenthalben suhte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1865" id="v1865" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1865" tabindex="-1">v1865</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2468
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in der arche er sie uant 1865<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1866" id="v1866" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1866" tabindex="-1">v1866</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2469
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er nam sie froliche in die hant<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1867" id="v1867" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1867" tabindex="-1">v1867</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2470
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do drang er uz der chirhtnr<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1868" id="v1868" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1868" tabindex="-1">v1868</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2471
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν zeigte die gerte her fur<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1869" id="v1869" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1869" tabindex="-1">v1869</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2472
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er sprah  Iosep gotes kint<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1870" id="v1870" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1870" tabindex="-1">v1870</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2473
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die engel dir gnsedik sint 1870<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1871" id="v1871" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1871" tabindex="-1">v1871</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2474
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sie ilent an dih zeigen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1872" id="v1872" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1872" tabindex="-1">v1872</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2475
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>disiv gerte ist din eigen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1873" id="v1873" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1873" tabindex="-1">v1873</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2476
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nu sûme dih niht mere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1874" id="v1874" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1874" tabindex="-1">v1874</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2477
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'wir bevelhen dir die maget here'''<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1875" id="v1875" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1875" tabindex="-1">v1875</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2478
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Iosep erchom do harte 1875<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1876" id="v1876" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1876" tabindex="-1">v1876</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2479
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz mit so lûtem worte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1877" id="v1877" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1877" tabindex="-1">v1877</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2480
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der bisgof in anrief<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1878" id="v1878" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1878" tabindex="-1">v1878</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2481
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sin gedanche waren tief<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1879" id="v1879" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1879" tabindex="-1">v1879</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2482
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er zwiuelt waz er tsete<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1880" id="v1880" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1880" tabindex="-1">v1880</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2483
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν wes got willen háfete 1880<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1881" id="v1881" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1881" tabindex="-1">v1881</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2484
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>doh enpfieng er daz ris<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1882" id="v1882" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1882" tabindex="-1">v1882</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2485
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sin bart was im lanch vnd gris<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1883" id="v1883" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1883" tabindex="-1">v1883</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2486
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>weinen begnnde er durh not<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
