         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2488
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2489
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2490
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2491
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2492
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2493
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1884" id="v1884" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1884" tabindex="-1">v1884</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2494
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν als er die gerte ufbot<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1885" id="v1885" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1885" tabindex="-1">v1885</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2495
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uor wiben ν uor mannen 1885<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1886" id="v1886" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1886" tabindex="-1">v1886</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2496
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ein tube swancli do dannen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1887" id="v1887" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1887" tabindex="-1">v1887</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2497
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ein vogel so wolgetan<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1888" id="v1888" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1888" tabindex="-1">v1888</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2498
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sin got must ere hân<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1889" id="v1889" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1889" tabindex="-1">v1889</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2499
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der swêimet ein wile da<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1890" id="v1890" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1890" tabindex="-1">v1890</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2500
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vnd hub sih danah sa 1890<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1891" id="v1891" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1891" tabindex="-1">v1891</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2501
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>gegen himel hin wider<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1892" id="v1892" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1892" tabindex="-1">v1892</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2502
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>danner chomen was her nider<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1893" id="v1893" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1893" tabindex="-1">v1893</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2503
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
