         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2526
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ein herze er gevie<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1902" id="v1902" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1902" tabindex="-1">v1902</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2527
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>fur den bisgof er gie<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1903" id="v1903" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1903" tabindex="-1">v1903</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2528
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν leint sih über sin chruken<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
