         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2532
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er bat sin got gehuken<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1905" id="v1905" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1905" tabindex="-1">v1905</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2533
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie in alle liezen 1905<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1906" id="v1906" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1906" tabindex="-1">v1906</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2534
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sines alters geniezen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1907" id="v1907" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1907" tabindex="-1">v1907</a>
