         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2535
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vnt in des niht endwngen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1908" id="v1908" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1908" tabindex="-1">v1908</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2536
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz er die maget ivnge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1909" id="v1909" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1909" tabindex="-1">v1909</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2537
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in sinen gewalt nseme<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1910" id="v1910" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1910" tabindex="-1">v1910</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2538
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er sprah wie er ir gezseme 1910<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
