         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2540
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Do trösten in die herren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1912" id="v1912" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1912" tabindex="-1">v1912</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2541
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>im enmsehte niht gewerren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1913" id="v1913" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1913" tabindex="-1">v1913</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2542
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>warumbe er truren scolte?<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1914" id="v1914" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1914" tabindex="-1">v1914</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2543
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>swaz got stiften wolte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1915" id="v1915" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1915" tabindex="-1">v1915</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2544
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
