         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2605
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>niht wolten gelöben 1960<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1961" id="v1961" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1961" tabindex="-1">v1961</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2606
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nv mache die rede niht ze lanch<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1962" id="v1962" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1962" tabindex="-1">v1962</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2607
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>la den strit volge uns ane wanch<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1963" id="v1963" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1963" tabindex="-1">v1963</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2608
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>gemoehel mit irolichem mvt<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1964" id="v1964" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1964" tabindex="-1">v1964</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2609
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die maget edel ν gut<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
