         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2612
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>5 e wir den hof rûmen 1965<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1966" id="v1966" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1966" tabindex="-1">v1966</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2613
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'du scholt uns niht lenger sumen'''<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1967" id="v1967" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1967" tabindex="-1">v1967</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2614
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Bo sprah der einualte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1968" id="v1968" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1968" tabindex="-1">v1968</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2615
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>got mit sinem gewalte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1969" id="v1969" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1969" tabindex="-1">v1969</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2616
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der bewise mich des besten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1970" id="v1970" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1970" tabindex="-1">v1970</a>
