         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2617
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wan swie so ih weste 1970<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1971" id="v1971" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1971" tabindex="-1">v1971</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2618
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ich die sele msehte ernern<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1972" id="v1972" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1972" tabindex="-1">v1972</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2619
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>waz scholt ich tivrers gern?<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1973" id="v1973" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1973" tabindex="-1">v1973</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2620
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ich wil iv sagen minen sin<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1974" id="v1974" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1974" tabindex="-1">v1974</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2621
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wand ich ein sundoere bin<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1975" id="v1975" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1975" tabindex="-1">v1975</a>
