         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2623
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>waz hülfe mik daz ob ich sie naeme?<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1977" id="v1977" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1977" tabindex="-1">v1977</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2624
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ez ist umbe mik nehein frum<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1978" id="v1978" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1978" tabindex="-1">v1978</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
