         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vil wolgetane degene<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1980" id="v1980" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1980" tabindex="-1">v1980</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2627
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die mir got gesegene 1980<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1981" id="v1981" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1981" tabindex="-1">v1981</a>
