         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2628
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die sint gftt ν wòlgeborn<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1982" id="v1982" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1982" tabindex="-1">v1982</a>
