         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2630
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>an die wil ik ir raten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1984" id="v1984" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1984" tabindex="-1">v1984</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2631
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vnd wil ez uor iv stseten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
