         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2634
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>15 daz ick ir mit bescheidener rede 19S5<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1986" id="v1986" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1986" tabindex="-1">v1986</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2635
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>minen gemahelsckatze gebe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1987" id="v1987" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1987" tabindex="-1">v1987</a>
