         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2639
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div mir uon got uerlihen sint 1990<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v1991" id="v1991" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v1991" tabindex="-1">v1991</a>
