         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2660
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die ladeten sie nf den frithof  2005<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2006" id="v2006" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2006" tabindex="-1">v2006</a>
