         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die frowen die ir waren bi<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2010" id="v2010" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2010" tabindex="-1">v2010</a>
