         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie trête froliche<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2013" id="v2013" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2013" tabindex="-1">v2013</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2668
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>swes man an sie mute<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2014" id="v2014" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2014" tabindex="-1">v2014</a>
