         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2669
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz wrde ir gewant ze gute<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2015" id="v2015" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2015" tabindex="-1">v2015</a>
