         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2671
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sie gie znhtekliche ν seine<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2017" id="v2017" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2017" tabindex="-1">v2017</a>
