         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2746
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>got der den eristen man<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2063" id="v2063" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2063" tabindex="-1">v2063</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2747
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uz 1 seime gebildet hat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2064" id="v2064" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2064" tabindex="-1">v2064</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2748
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν des tronus inme himele stat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2065" id="v2065" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2065" tabindex="-1">v2065</a>
