         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2749
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der oh geschuf den witen umbechreiz 2065<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2066" id="v2066" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2066" tabindex="-1">v2066</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2750
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>elliv dinch er wol weiz<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2067" id="v2067" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2067" tabindex="-1">v2067</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2751
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wir mugen in nihtes uerheln<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2068" id="v2068" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2068" tabindex="-1">v2068</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2752
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>niht uersagen noh uersteln<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2069" id="v2069" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2069" tabindex="-1">v2069</a>
