         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2814
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ein guldin vingerlin<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2110" id="v2110" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2110" tabindex="-1">v2110</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2815
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz enpfie sie uon der hant sin 2110<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2816
