         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2837
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sine waere mit ir gespiln<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2130" id="v2130" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2130" tabindex="-1">v2130</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2838
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>anders miiste sie beviln 2130<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2131" id="v2131" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2131" tabindex="-1">v2131</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2839
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν betragen miner uzverte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2132" id="v2132" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2132" tabindex="-1">v2132</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2840
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
