         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2847
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die geantwrte ih iv widere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2137" id="v2137" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2137" tabindex="-1">v2137</a>
