         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2850
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>durh ivwer aller minne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2140" id="v2140" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2140" tabindex="-1">v2140</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2851
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so bin ih wol gestîvret hinnen 2140<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2141" id="v2141" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2141" tabindex="-1">v2141</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2852
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
