         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>selbe welen darinne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2147" id="v2147" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2147" tabindex="-1">v2147</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2858
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do nam sie die liebesten vnder in<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2148" id="v2148" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2148" tabindex="-1">v2148</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v2859
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>hinze den sie truch ir sin<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
