         </span>do wart ein strit vil groz<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2272" id="v2272" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2272" tabindex="-1">v2272</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3022
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die froen wrfen ir loz<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2273" id="v2273" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2273" tabindex="-1">v2273</a>
