         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3023
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wa der purper vnt die siden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2274" id="v2274" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2274" tabindex="-1">v2274</a>
