         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3032
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des wolt ieglich magedin<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2280" id="v2280" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2280" tabindex="-1">v2280</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3033
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vil gerne uberk worden sin 2280<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2281" id="v2281" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2281" tabindex="-1">v2281</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3034
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Do geviel daz loz an daz kint<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2282" id="v2282" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2282" tabindex="-1">v2282</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3035
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>dannen div guten wip sint<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2283" id="v2283" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2283" tabindex="-1">v2283</a>
