         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3043
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div enlîe daz niht ane nit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2290" id="v2290" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2290" tabindex="-1">v2290</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
