         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3085
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vnt deuch ir reine hende<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2325" id="v2325" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2325" tabindex="-1">v2325</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3086
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do sie ein wile da gesaz 2325<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2326" id="v2326" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2326" tabindex="-1">v2326</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3087
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>aller trivwen liehtuaz<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2327" id="v2327" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2327" tabindex="-1">v2327</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3088
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>unt anders niemen bi ir was<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2328" id="v2328" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2328" tabindex="-1">v2328</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3089
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ein engel lvter sam daz glas<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2329" id="v2329" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2329" tabindex="-1">v2329</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3090
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit grozer gute beuangen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2330" id="v2330" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2330" tabindex="-1">v2330</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3091
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der chom zu ir gegangen 2330<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2331" id="v2331" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2331" tabindex="-1">v2331</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3092
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν bat sie wesen ân leide<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
