         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3095
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>gnade fròde V wêide<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2333" id="v2333" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2333" tabindex="-1">v2333</a>
