         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3105
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz lange in der vinster niht<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2339" id="v2339" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2339" tabindex="-1">v2339</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3106
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>msehte sin uerborgen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2340" id="v2340" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2340" tabindex="-1">v2340</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3107
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sie wafere div alle sorgen 2340<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2341" id="v2341" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2341" tabindex="-1">v2341</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3108
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
