         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3231
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2423" id="v2423" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2423" tabindex="-1">v2423</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3232
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vñ hat dih darzu erchorn<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2424" id="v2424" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2424" tabindex="-1">v2424</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3233
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz er uon dir werde geborn<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2425" id="v2425" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2425" tabindex="-1">v2425</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3234
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>bi dir wil er beliben 2425<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2426" id="v2426" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2426" tabindex="-1">v2426</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3235
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>gesegentiv ob allen wiben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2427" id="v2427" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2427" tabindex="-1">v2427</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3236
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>dir niget swaz sih chan uerstân<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3237
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3238
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3239
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
