         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3240
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2428" id="v2428" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2428" tabindex="-1">v2428</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3241
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>(lu scliolt ze brutbette gan<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2429" id="v2429" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2429" tabindex="-1">v2429</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3242
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in dem himele obene<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2430" id="v2430" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2430" tabindex="-1">v2430</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3243
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'des Wirdes tu ze lobene'' 2430'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2431" id="v2431" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2431" tabindex="-1">v2431</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3244
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Div maget begunde denchen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2432" id="v2432" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2432" tabindex="-1">v2432</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3245
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div ovgen nider senchen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2433" id="v2433" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2433" tabindex="-1">v2433</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3246
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sie nam ez in ir ahte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2434" id="v2434" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2434" tabindex="-1">v2434</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3247
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wie daz werden maehte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2435" id="v2435" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2435" tabindex="-1">v2435</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3248
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν wie dem gruzsal wáre 2435<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2436" id="v2436" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2436" tabindex="-1">v2436</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3249
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>trurik stunt di ν gewáfere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
