         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3258
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>got hat in dinem libe 2440<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2441" id="v2441" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2441" tabindex="-1">v2441</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3259
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>im erweit ein sal<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2442" id="v2442" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2442" tabindex="-1">v2442</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3260
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>du scholt der werlte uberai<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2443" id="v2443" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2443" tabindex="-1">v2443</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3261
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>bringen einen sun<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2444" id="v2444" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2444" tabindex="-1">v2444</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3262
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der in gnade mak getun<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2445" id="v2445" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2445" tabindex="-1">v2445</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3263
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er wirt genant Emanuel 2445<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2446" id="v2446" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2446" tabindex="-1">v2446</a>
