         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2447" id="v2447" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2447" tabindex="-1">v2447</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3268
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Div maget die vorhte uerlie<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2448" id="v2448" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2448" tabindex="-1">v2448</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3269
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>einen guten mut sie geuie<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2449" id="v2449" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2449" tabindex="-1">v2449</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3270
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ir selber kivsche sie ansach<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2450" id="v2450" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2450" tabindex="-1">v2450</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3271
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ze dem engel si do sprah 2450<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2451" id="v2451" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2451" tabindex="-1">v2451</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3272
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ia ne han ich niht betrahte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
