         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3274
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wie daz ergen moehte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2453" id="v2453" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2453" tabindex="-1">v2453</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3275
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>20 daz ich kint gebäre<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2454" id="v2454" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2454" tabindex="-1">v2454</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3276
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν iedoh maget wäre<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2455" id="v2455" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2455" tabindex="-1">v2455</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3277
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ich bin so komen an dise stunt 2455<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2456" id="v2456" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2456" tabindex="-1">v2456</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3278
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz mir ist vil unkunt<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2457" id="v2457" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2457" tabindex="-1">v2457</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3279
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mannes liebe ν geuerte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2458" id="v2458" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2458" tabindex="-1">v2458</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3280
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit flizze ih mih des werte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2459" id="v2459" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2459" tabindex="-1">v2459</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3281
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν oh iemer gerne tun<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2460" id="v2460" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2460" tabindex="-1">v2460</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3282
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
