         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'dez muz mih nemen wnder'''<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2462" id="v2462" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2462" tabindex="-1">v2462</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3284
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sa aníwrten begunder<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2463" id="v2463" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2463" tabindex="-1">v2463</a>
