         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3292
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>unt der vil heilige geist 2465<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2466" id="v2466" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2466" tabindex="-1">v2466</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3293
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der wirt des kindes uolleist<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2467" id="v2467" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2467" tabindex="-1">v2467</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3294
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des oberisten tugent ν maht<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2468" id="v2468" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2468" tabindex="-1">v2468</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3295
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>gezoeiget dir wol die ahte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
