         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3298
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wie im daz mugliche si<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2470" id="v2470" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2470" tabindex="-1">v2470</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3299
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz er dir also wone bi 2470<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2471" id="v2471" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2471" tabindex="-1">v2471</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3300
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span> mit sines geistes towe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2472" id="v2472" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2472" tabindex="-1">v2472</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3301
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>bescâtewet er dih fröwe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2473" id="v2473" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2473" tabindex="-1">v2473</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3302
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν gefurdert dih darzu<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2474" id="v2474" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2474" tabindex="-1">v2474</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3303
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>iz wart geordent vil fru<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2475" id="v2475" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2475" tabindex="-1">v2475</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3304
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ez also schölte ergan 2175<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2476" id="v2476" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2476" tabindex="-1">v2476</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3305
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>e div erde begunde stan<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2477" id="v2477" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2477" tabindex="-1">v2477</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3306
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν der himel swebende wrde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
