         </span>daz er dem tieyil wirt erwert<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2573" id="v2573" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2573" tabindex="-1">v2573</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3428
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des haben wir manek urchunde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2574" id="v2574" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2574" tabindex="-1">v2574</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3429
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>non sin selbes munde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2575" id="v2575" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2575" tabindex="-1">v2575</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3430
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der durh uns ist geborn 2575<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2576" id="v2576" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2576" tabindex="-1">v2576</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3431
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz im nieman werde uerlorn<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2577" id="v2577" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2577" tabindex="-1">v2577</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3432
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>niewan der da misseträwet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2578" id="v2578" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2578" tabindex="-1">v2578</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3433
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>y den sin schulde niht gerivwet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2579" id="v2579" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2579" tabindex="-1">v2579</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3434
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ist div fròde gemeine<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2580" id="v2580" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2580" tabindex="-1">v2580</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3435
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die uns brahte div maget reine 2580<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2581" id="v2581" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2581" tabindex="-1">v2581</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3436
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Swer non der guten sprechen wolte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2582" id="v2582" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2582" tabindex="-1">v2582</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3437
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vil sinnes er haben schölte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2583" id="v2583" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2583" tabindex="-1">v2583</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3438
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>dazu tugent ν gute<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2584" id="v2584" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2584" tabindex="-1">v2584</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3439
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz er mit reinem gemute<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2585" id="v2585" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2585" tabindex="-1">v2585</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3440
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ir lop moehte geuahen 25S5<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2586" id="v2586" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2586" tabindex="-1">v2586</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3441
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ist mir leider unnahen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2587" id="v2587" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2587" tabindex="-1">v2587</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3442
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>5 durh min snntliche bürde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2588" id="v2588" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2588" tabindex="-1">v2588</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3443
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>doh gedinge ich daz got wrde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2589" id="v2589" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2589" tabindex="-1">v2589</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3444
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>menniske dvrh die armen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2590" id="v2590" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2590" tabindex="-1">v2590</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3445
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν der da wolte erwärmen 2690<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2591" id="v2591" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2591" tabindex="-1">v2591</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3446
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nf msegetlicher brüste<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2592" id="v2592" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2592" tabindex="-1">v2592</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3447
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ein sundarinne div chnste<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2593" id="v2593" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2593" tabindex="-1">v2593</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3448
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'div ttf''ch div trukent im sin fuzze'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2594" id="v2594" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2594" tabindex="-1">v2594</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3449
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν gesteich zu sinem gruzze<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2595" id="v2595" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2595" tabindex="-1">v2595</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3450
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>10 ioh daz sie gewan sine hulde 2595<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2596" id="v2596" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2596" tabindex="-1">v2596</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3451
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sus wart div schuldige âne schulde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2597" id="v2597" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2597" tabindex="-1">v2597</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3452
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν div swarce wol getan<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2598" id="v2598" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2598" tabindex="-1">v2598</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3453
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des dinge och ih sunder wân<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2599" id="v2599" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2599" tabindex="-1">v2599</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3454
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so uerre daz ich ernenne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2600" id="v2600" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2600" tabindex="-1">v2600</a>
