         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3731
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>todes vorhte gotes minne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2758" id="v2758" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2758" tabindex="-1">v2758</a>
