         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3775
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3776
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3777
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3778
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3779
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3780
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2787" id="v2787" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2787" tabindex="-1">v2787</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3781
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Daz was sante Iohannes<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2788" id="v2788" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2788" tabindex="-1">v2788</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3782
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ungeborner uerstunt er sih des<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3783
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2789" id="v2789" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2789" tabindex="-1">v2789</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3784
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>bi siner muter herzen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2790" id="v2790" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2790" tabindex="-1">v2790</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3785
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz uon dem tivren mercen 2790<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2791" id="v2791" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2791" tabindex="-1">v2791</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3786
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die sundsere ν die notigen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2792" id="v2792" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2792" tabindex="-1">v2792</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3787
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>dem tieuel schölten angesigen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2793" id="v2793" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2793" tabindex="-1">v2793</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3788
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν daz div maget komen was<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2794" id="v2794" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2794" tabindex="-1">v2794</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3789
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div des kindes sit gnas<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2795" id="v2795" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2795" tabindex="-1">v2795</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3790
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den nie sunde betwanch 2795<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2796" id="v2796" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2796" tabindex="-1">v2796</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3791
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν an der der gotes gedanch<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2797" id="v2797" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2797" tabindex="-1">v2797</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3792
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ioh sin gute ruwen wolte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2798" id="v2798" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2798" tabindex="-1">v2798</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3793
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν dm ein blume sin schölte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2799" id="v2799" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2799" tabindex="-1">v2799</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3794
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da aller geiste beste<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2800" id="v2800" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2800" tabindex="-1">v2800</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3795
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>inne hete reste 2800<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3796
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3797
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2801" id="v2801" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2801" tabindex="-1">v2801</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3798
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do der gotes töfaere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2802" id="v2802" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2802" tabindex="-1">v2802</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3799
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν sin uorbot m sere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3800
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3801
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2803" id="v2803" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2803" tabindex="-1">v2803</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3802
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>was ce sinen iaren komen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2804" id="v2804" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2804" tabindex="-1">v2804</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3803
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>als wirz han uernomen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2805" id="v2805" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2805" tabindex="-1">v2805</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3804
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er zseigete an den heilant 2805<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2806" id="v2806" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2806" tabindex="-1">v2806</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3805
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den uns got vater sante<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3806
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2807" id="v2807" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2807" tabindex="-1">v2807</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3807
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz er mit sinem tröste<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2808" id="v2808" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2808" tabindex="-1">v2808</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3808
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die Christenheit erloste<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2809" id="v2809" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2809" tabindex="-1">v2809</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3809
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>v daz er meil nie gewan<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2810" id="v2810" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2810" tabindex="-1">v2810</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3810
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>als er in do tSfen began 2810<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2811" id="v2811" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2811" tabindex="-1">v2811</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3811
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der himel sih ob im uf tet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2812" id="v2812" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2812" tabindex="-1">v2812</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3812
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>im ze eren da ze stet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2813" id="v2813" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2813" tabindex="-1">v2813</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3813
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ein tube here vf im erschêine<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2814" id="v2814" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2814" tabindex="-1">v2814</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3814
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der nie glich wart dehêine<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3815
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3816
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3817
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
