         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3818
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3819
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3820
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3821
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3822
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3823
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3824
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2815" id="v2815" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2815" tabindex="-1">v2815</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3825
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die sah er ob im sweben 2815<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2816" id="v2816" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2816" tabindex="-1">v2816</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3826
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν horte got urkunde geben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2817" id="v2817" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2817" tabindex="-1">v2817</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3827
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sende Marien kinde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2818" id="v2818" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2818" tabindex="-1">v2818</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3828
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz er der si da man vinde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2819" id="v2819" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2819" tabindex="-1">v2819</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3829
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>gnade div niemer zegat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2820" id="v2820" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2820" tabindex="-1">v2820</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3830
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν des riche ane ende stat 2820<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3831
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3832
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3833
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2821" id="v2821" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2821" tabindex="-1">v2821</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3834
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Ich en wil an disen stunden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2822" id="v2822" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2822" tabindex="-1">v2822</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3835
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>niht gantzlichen chunden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2823" id="v2823" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2823" tabindex="-1">v2823</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3836
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>eaent Iohannis ere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2824" id="v2824" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2824" tabindex="-1">v2824</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3837
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>untze ich daz liet furchere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2825" id="v2825" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2825" tabindex="-1">v2825</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3838
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in unser froen minne 2825<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2826" id="v2826" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2826" tabindex="-1">v2826</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3839
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ir ze lobe mir ze gwinne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
