         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3848
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3849
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2827" id="v2827" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2827" tabindex="-1">v2827</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3850
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Daz ander lieth hat ende<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2828" id="v2828" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2828" tabindex="-1">v2828</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3851
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>an daz dritte ich wende<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2829" id="v2829" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2829" tabindex="-1">v2829</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3852
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>min sinne ν min zûnge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2830" id="v2830" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2830" tabindex="-1">v2830</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3853
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>allen den ze bezzerunge 2830<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2831" id="v2831" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2831" tabindex="-1">v2831</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3854
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>1831 die unser fröen minnent<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2832" id="v2832" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2832" tabindex="-1">v2832</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3855
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν ir gnaden sinnent<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2833" id="v2833" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2833" tabindex="-1">v2833</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3856
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nu wizzet daz ich iv bescheide<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2834" id="v2834" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2834" tabindex="-1">v2834</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3857
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>waz der kuniginne ze leide<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
