         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3864
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2835" id="v2835" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2835" tabindex="-1">v2835</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3865
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>gefrvmte ν geriet 2835<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2836" id="v2836" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2836" tabindex="-1">v2836</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3866
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div ubel ivdiskiv diet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3867
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2837" id="v2837" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2837" tabindex="-1">v2837</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3868
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sie leit itwize vil<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2838" id="v2838" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2838" tabindex="-1">v2838</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3869
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die warheit ich dauon wil<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2839" id="v2839" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2839" tabindex="-1">v2839</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3870
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>5 chunden ν maeren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2840" id="v2840" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2840" tabindex="-1">v2840</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3871
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vnde mit den heiligen bewären 2840<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2841" id="v2841" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2841" tabindex="-1">v2841</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3872
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ih sage iv wie sie Christ gebar<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
