         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2847" id="v2847" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2847" tabindex="-1">v2847</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3885
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div herze der einualten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2848" id="v2848" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2848" tabindex="-1">v2848</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3886
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div schuln sie wol behalten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2849" id="v2849" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2849" tabindex="-1">v2849</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3887
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wände sie also wâr ist<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2850" id="v2850" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2850" tabindex="-1">v2850</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3888
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so daz unser heilant Christ 2850<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2851" id="v2851" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2851" tabindex="-1">v2851</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3889
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uon der magede wart geborn<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2852" id="v2852" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2852" tabindex="-1">v2852</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3890
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν ir kivscheit nie wart uerlorn<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2853" id="v2853" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2853" tabindex="-1">v2853</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3891
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Swelh wib div driu liet hat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2854" id="v2854" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2854" tabindex="-1">v2854</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3892
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so sie ze keminaten gart<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2855" id="v2855" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2855" tabindex="-1">v2855</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3893
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in ir zeswen beuangen 2855<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2856" id="v2856" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2856" tabindex="-1">v2856</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3894
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sie lidet unlangen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2857" id="v2857" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2857" tabindex="-1">v2857</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3895
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>kumber uon dem sere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2858" id="v2858" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2858" tabindex="-1">v2858</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3896
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wand in unser froen ere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2859" id="v2859" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2859" tabindex="-1">v2859</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3897
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>gnist sie kindes gnsedeklichen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
