         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3902
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2860" id="v2860" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2860" tabindex="-1">v2860</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3903
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die sorgen muzzen entwichen 2860<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2861" id="v2861" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2861" tabindex="-1">v2861</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3904
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν div unchraft also bose<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2862" id="v2862" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2862" tabindex="-1">v2862</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3905
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die Even getlose<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2863" id="v2863" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2863" tabindex="-1">v2863</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3906
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in die Werlte gesante<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2864" id="v2864" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2864" tabindex="-1">v2864</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3907
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do si gotes niht erkante<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2865" id="v2865" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2865" tabindex="-1">v2865</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3908
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν mit dem gnadelosen man 2865<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2866" id="v2866" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2866" tabindex="-1">v2866</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3909
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uon gote uallen began<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2867" id="v2867" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2867" tabindex="-1">v2867</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3910
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Swa din buchel driv sint behalten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
