         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3993
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2877" id="v2877" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2877" tabindex="-1">v2877</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3994
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Div here maget sente Marie<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2878" id="v2878" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2878" tabindex="-1">v2878</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3995
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>geruche die namen drie<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2879" id="v2879" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2879" tabindex="-1">v2879</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3996
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>umbe uns armen biien<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2880" id="v2880" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2880" tabindex="-1">v2880</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3997
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz wir mit reinen siten 2880<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2881" id="v2881" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2881" tabindex="-1">v2881</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3998
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di hulde muzzen erwerben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2882" id="v2882" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2882" tabindex="-1">v2882</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v3999
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν ir helfe so wir ersterben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2883" id="v2883" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2883" tabindex="-1">v2883</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4000
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>y gnade an der urstende<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2884" id="v2884" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2884" tabindex="-1">v2884</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4001
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so al div Werlte hat ende<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2885" id="v2885" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2885" tabindex="-1">v2885</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4002
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>30 da sih hebet daz tseidinch 2885<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2886" id="v2886" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2886" tabindex="-1">v2886</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4003
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz groze gerihte y der rinch<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2887" id="v2887" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2887" tabindex="-1">v2887</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4004
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den nîemen enpfliehen mach<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2888" id="v2888" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2888" tabindex="-1">v2888</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4005
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wân der eine der den tak<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2889" id="v2889" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2889" tabindex="-1">v2889</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4006
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>hie wol vorbesorget hat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2890" id="v2890" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2890" tabindex="-1">v2890</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4007
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>owi waz trostes «m dazu gat 2890<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2891" id="v2891" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2891" tabindex="-1">v2891</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4008
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>als daz urteile wirt<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4009
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4010
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4011
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4012
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4013
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2892" id="v2892" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2892" tabindex="-1">v2892</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4014
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν der uorhtliche huswirt<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2893" id="v2893" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2893" tabindex="-1">v2893</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4015
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>35 mit zorne beginnet scheiden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4016
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2894" id="v2894" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2894" tabindex="-1">v2894</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4017
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die lieben uon den leiden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2895" id="v2895" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2895" tabindex="-1">v2895</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4018
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>siniv kint non den chnehten 2895<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2896" id="v2896" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2896" tabindex="-1">v2896</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4019
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die sundoere non den rehten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2897" id="v2897" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2897" tabindex="-1">v2897</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4020
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die ubeln non den guten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2898" id="v2898" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2898" tabindex="-1">v2898</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4021
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da ruche div gute behüten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2899" id="v2899" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2899" tabindex="-1">v2899</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4022
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>alle die sih nu dazu mûzzent<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2900" id="v2900" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2900" tabindex="-1">v2900</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4023
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz si sie mit dienste grûzzent 2900<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2901" id="v2901" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2901" tabindex="-1">v2901</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4024
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>gut ist uns der gedinge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4025
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4026
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
