         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4029
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4030
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4031
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4032
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4033
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4034
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4035
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4036
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2902" id="v2902" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2902" tabindex="-1">v2902</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4037
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ze dem notlichem tseidinge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2903" id="v2903" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2903" tabindex="-1">v2903</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4038
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>18340 wan da gesitzet sie bi siten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2904" id="v2904" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2904" tabindex="-1">v2904</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4039
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>dem kunige der so witen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2905" id="v2905" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2905" tabindex="-1">v2905</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4040
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>richsent V gebivtei 2905<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2906" id="v2906" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2906" tabindex="-1">v2906</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4041
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>dem himel der erde dem livte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4042
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4043
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2907" id="v2907" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2907" tabindex="-1">v2907</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4044
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>al des wir ie gedahten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2908" id="v2908" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2908" tabindex="-1">v2908</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4045
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz wir hinnen brahten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2909" id="v2909" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2909" tabindex="-1">v2909</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4046
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ane bûzze V ane bihte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2910" id="v2910" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2910" tabindex="-1">v2910</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4047
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz gestat da niht lihte 2910<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2911" id="v2911" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2911" tabindex="-1">v2911</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4048
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>als wir uns gedenken<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2912" id="v2912" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2912" tabindex="-1">v2912</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4049
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wirne mugen da niht gewenken<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2913" id="v2913" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2913" tabindex="-1">v2913</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4050
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>45 aller herzen tägen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2914" id="v2914" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2914" tabindex="-1">v2914</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4051
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>megen wir niht uertögen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2915" id="v2915" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2915" tabindex="-1">v2915</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4052
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uns kûmet da ze gehucke 2915<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4053
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2916" id="v2916" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2916" tabindex="-1">v2916</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4054
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>swaz wir ie zerucke<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2917" id="v2917" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2917" tabindex="-1">v2917</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4055
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>1841 sunden hie gewrfen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2918" id="v2918" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2918" tabindex="-1">v2918</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4056
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die der fröen da bedürfen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2919" id="v2919" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2919" tabindex="-1">v2919</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4057
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν ir helfe gerne da sehen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2920" id="v2920" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2920" tabindex="-1">v2920</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4058
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die schuln 5h ir n&amp; iehen 2920<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2921" id="v2921" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2921" tabindex="-1">v2921</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4059
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ze kuniginne mit dienste<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2922" id="v2922" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2922" tabindex="-1">v2922</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4060
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz wirt in dort daz liebeste<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2923" id="v2923" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2923" tabindex="-1">v2923</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4061
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ob sie hant ir minne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4062
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4063
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4064
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4065
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2924" id="v2924" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2924" tabindex="-1">v2924</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4066
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wellen ave wir die voitinne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2925" id="v2925" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2925" tabindex="-1">v2925</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4067
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>5 niht gewissen hie mit staete 2925<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2926" id="v2926" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2926" tabindex="-1">v2926</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4068
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so wirt ez uns dort al ze spsete<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2927" id="v2927" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2927" tabindex="-1">v2927</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4069
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Daz dritte liet heve ih ane<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2928" id="v2928" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2928" tabindex="-1">v2928</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4070
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>als die riter zu dem uane<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2929" id="v2929" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2929" tabindex="-1">v2929</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4071
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uaste muzzen sigen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2930" id="v2930" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2930" tabindex="-1">v2930</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4072
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ki allen uolchwigen 2930<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2931" id="v2931" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2931" tabindex="-1">v2931</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4073
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>also schulen wir zu dem sterne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2932" id="v2932" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2932" tabindex="-1">v2932</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4074
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>fluhte haben gerne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2933" id="v2933" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2933" tabindex="-1">v2933</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4075
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>10 der daz christenliche here<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2934" id="v2934" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2934" tabindex="-1">v2934</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4076
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>bringet über der sorgen mere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2935" id="v2935" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2935" tabindex="-1">v2935</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4077
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uz des tieuels bande 2935<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2936" id="v2936" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2936" tabindex="-1">v2936</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4078
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>zu dem fröderichem lande<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2937" id="v2937" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2937" tabindex="-1">v2937</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4079
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da got selbe ist der sunne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2938" id="v2938" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2938" tabindex="-1">v2938</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4080
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ist der tak ist div wnne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2939" id="v2939" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2939" tabindex="-1">v2939</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4081
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die nehein trübe chrenket<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2940" id="v2940" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2940" tabindex="-1">v2940</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4082
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν niemer gewenchet 2940<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4083
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4084
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4085
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4086
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4087
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2941" id="v2941" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2941" tabindex="-1">v2941</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4088
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nu gehuget wol liebiv kint<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2942" id="v2942" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2942" tabindex="-1">v2942</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4089
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die sente Marien uolgende sint<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2943" id="v2943" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2943" tabindex="-1">v2943</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4090
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>15 ? sie uon herzen meinent<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2944" id="v2944" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2944" tabindex="-1">v2944</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4091
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so sie ir sunde weinent<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2945" id="v2945" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2945" tabindex="-1">v2945</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4092
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>gedenchet wol wie ich han gesaget 2945<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2946" id="v2946" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2946" tabindex="-1">v2946</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4093
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz div ewige maget<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2947" id="v2947" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2947" tabindex="-1">v2947</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4094
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Iosebe wart gemsehelot<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2948" id="v2948" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2948" tabindex="-1">v2948</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4095
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des sie hengen muste durh not<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2949" id="v2949" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2949" tabindex="-1">v2949</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4096
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>V wie er mit ir was da heime<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2950" id="v2950" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2950" tabindex="-1">v2950</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4097
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>untze er bi des meres reine 2950<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4098
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4099
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4100
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4101
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4102
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4103
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2951" id="v2951" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2951" tabindex="-1">v2951</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4104
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>20 ze Capharnaum cherte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2952" id="v2952" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2952" tabindex="-1">v2952</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4105
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da er sin ivngere lerte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2953" id="v2953" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2953" tabindex="-1">v2953</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4106
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uon meisterlichen sachen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2954" id="v2954" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2954" tabindex="-1">v2954</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4107
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wie sie schölten machen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2955" id="v2955" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2955" tabindex="-1">v2955</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4108
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die notuesten chiele 2955<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2956" id="v2956" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2956" tabindex="-1">v2956</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4109
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der chraft nien lihte ceuiele<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4110
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4111
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4112
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4113
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2957" id="v2957" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2957" tabindex="-1">v2957</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4114
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uf den hohen anden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2958" id="v2958" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2958" tabindex="-1">v2958</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4115
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so die winde Unsitten begunden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4116
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2959" id="v2959" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2959" tabindex="-1">v2959</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4117
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der alte brûtdegen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2960" id="v2960" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2960" tabindex="-1">v2960</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4118
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der was gewesen underwegen 2960<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2961" id="v2961" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2961" tabindex="-1">v2961</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4119
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span> 25 drie manot vnd ein halbez iâr<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2962" id="v2962" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2962" tabindex="-1">v2962</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4120
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>untzer gefrumet vil gar<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2963" id="v2963" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2963" tabindex="-1">v2963</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4121
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des in die herren baten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2964" id="v2964" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2964" tabindex="-1">v2964</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4122
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die in geladet haten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2965" id="v2965" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2965" tabindex="-1">v2965</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4123
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>darnah wart er des ennêin 2965<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2966" id="v2966" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2966" tabindex="-1">v2966</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4124
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz er fare wider heim<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2967" id="v2967" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2967" tabindex="-1">v2967</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4125
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in die burch ze Nazaret<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2968" id="v2968" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2968" tabindex="-1">v2968</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4126
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div mit grozzem lobe stet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2969" id="v2969" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2969" tabindex="-1">v2969</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4127
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in sente Marien gute <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2970" id="v2970" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2970" tabindex="-1">v2970</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4128
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>dar truch in sin gemute 2970<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2971" id="v2971" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2971" tabindex="-1">v2971</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4129
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Sin hiwisch v div magedin<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2972" id="v2972" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2972" tabindex="-1">v2972</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4130
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>hiezzen in willikomen sin<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2973" id="v2973" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2973" tabindex="-1">v2973</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4131
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit frolichem anpfange<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
