         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4133
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do stnnt ez anlange<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2975" id="v2975" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2975" tabindex="-1">v2975</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4134
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nutzer des wart inne 2975<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2976" id="v2976" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2976" tabindex="-1">v2976</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4135
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>an der heren kunginne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2977" id="v2977" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2977" tabindex="-1">v2977</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4136
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie lebentigez kint truch<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2978" id="v2978" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2978" tabindex="-1">v2978</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4137
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do gewan er leides genueh<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2979" id="v2979" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2979" tabindex="-1">v2979</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4138
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>harte wndert in daran<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2980" id="v2980" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2980" tabindex="-1">v2980</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4139
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wie sie iemer dehein man 2980<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2981" id="v2981" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2981" tabindex="-1">v2981</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4140
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>schölte han uberkomen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2982" id="v2982" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2982" tabindex="-1">v2982</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4141
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div bi der spise was gezogen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2983" id="v2983" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2983" tabindex="-1">v2983</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4142
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div ir in engelisker haut<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2984" id="v2984" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2984" tabindex="-1">v2984</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4143
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uon himel wart gesant<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2985" id="v2985" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2985" tabindex="-1">v2985</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4144
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der uil einualte man 2985<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2986" id="v2986" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2986" tabindex="-1">v2986</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4145
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der hete uorhteu y wan<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2987" id="v2987" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2987" tabindex="-1">v2987</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4146
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie mit böser sache<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2988" id="v2988" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2988" tabindex="-1">v2988</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4147
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ze solhem ungemache<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2989" id="v2989" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2989" tabindex="-1">v2989</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4148
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>woere uerraten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2990" id="v2990" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2990" tabindex="-1">v2990</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4149
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die fröen in alle baten 2990<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2991" id="v2991" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2991" tabindex="-1">v2991</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4150
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz er sih wol gehabete<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2992" id="v2992" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2992" tabindex="-1">v2992</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4151
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν mazlichen chlagete<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2993" id="v2993" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2993" tabindex="-1">v2993</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4152
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sie sageten ir uiischulde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2994" id="v2994" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2994" tabindex="-1">v2994</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4153
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν swren bi gotes hulde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2995" id="v2995" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2995" tabindex="-1">v2995</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4154
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div geistlichen wip 2995<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2996" id="v2996" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2996" tabindex="-1">v2996</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4155
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>butten sele ν lip<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2997" id="v2997" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2997" tabindex="-1">v2997</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4156
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz nie man bechome<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2998" id="v2998" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2998" tabindex="-1">v2998</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4157
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>zu der magede schone<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v2999" id="v2999" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v2999" tabindex="-1">v2999</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4158
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit neheinem ungeuerte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3000" id="v3000" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3000" tabindex="-1">v3000</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4159
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
