         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4160
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie über strazze gienge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3002" id="v3002" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3002" tabindex="-1">v3002</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4161
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>unde iemen da enpfienge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3003" id="v3003" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3003" tabindex="-1">v3003</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4162
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>siene mohten an ir niht wandels wizzen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
