         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4168
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4169
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3004" id="v3004" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3004" tabindex="-1">v3004</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4170
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wan sie haete sih geflizzen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3005" id="v3005" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3005" tabindex="-1">v3005</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4171
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wol so tugentlicher güte 3005<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3006" id="v3006" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3006" tabindex="-1">v3006</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4172
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie ir eren gerne hâte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3007" id="v3007" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3007" tabindex="-1">v3007</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4173
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν sich selbe zaller stunde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3008" id="v3008" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3008" tabindex="-1">v3008</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4174
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wol bewaren künde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
