         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3009" id="v3009" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3009" tabindex="-1">v3009</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4178
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Der grise mit dem barte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3010" id="v3010" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3010" tabindex="-1">v3010</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4179
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
