         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4180
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sin ser γ sin nngemah<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3012" id="v3012" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3012" tabindex="-1">v3012</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4181
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ze den froen er clo sprah<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3013" id="v3013" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3013" tabindex="-1">v3013</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4182
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>durh got wes weit ir iehen?<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
