         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3014" id="v3014" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3014" tabindex="-1">v3014</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4184
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ia meget ir selbe sehen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3015" id="v3015" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3015" tabindex="-1">v3015</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
