         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4187
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ir mih so umbefûeret?<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3018" id="v3018" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3018" tabindex="-1">v3018</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4188
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ich lie sie unberûeret<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3019" id="v3019" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3019" tabindex="-1">v3019</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4189
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν han sie grozze funden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3020" id="v3020" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3020" tabindex="-1">v3020</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4190
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des bin ich mit leide gebunden3020<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3021" id="v3021" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3021" tabindex="-1">v3021</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4191
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>owe mir dirre warheit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3022" id="v3022" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3022" tabindex="-1">v3022</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4192
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>hie schult ir min herzeleit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
