         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3023" id="v3023" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3023" tabindex="-1">v3023</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4198
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>alle scöen vnde chiesen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3024" id="v3024" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3024" tabindex="-1">v3024</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4199
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>maeht ich nv uerliesen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3025" id="v3025" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3025" tabindex="-1">v3025</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4200
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>minen lip mit reliteu zugen 3025<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3026" id="v3026" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3026" tabindex="-1">v3026</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4201
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>e mich div litte belugen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3027" id="v3027" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3027" tabindex="-1">v3027</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4202
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des duhte mich zit furware<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3028" id="v3028" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3028" tabindex="-1">v3028</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4203
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>owi wan ich tot wäre<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3029" id="v3029" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3029" tabindex="-1">v3029</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4204
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ich daz unsaelige leben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3030" id="v3030" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3030" tabindex="-1">v3030</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4205
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit eren hete begeôen 3030<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3031" id="v3031" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3031" tabindex="-1">v3031</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4206
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>e mich begriffe diser schal<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3032" id="v3032" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3032" tabindex="-1">v3032</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4207
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der nn schière uert uberal<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3033" id="v3033" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3033" tabindex="-1">v3033</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4208
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uon miner ivncfröen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3034" id="v3034" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3034" tabindex="-1">v3034</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4209
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>als man beginnet scöen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3035" id="v3035" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3035" tabindex="-1">v3035</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4210
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz kint ioh die wiegen 3035<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3036" id="v3036" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3036" tabindex="-1">v3036</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4211
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>molich ist div werlt zetriegen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3037" id="v3037" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3037" tabindex="-1">v3037</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4212
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>angestliche daz gerihte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3038" id="v3038" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3038" tabindex="-1">v3038</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4213
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da zaller livte gesihte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3039" id="v3039" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3039" tabindex="-1">v3039</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4214
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz unreht wirt ernam<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3040" id="v3040" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3040" tabindex="-1">v3040</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4215
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wie mak ich daz iemer bewarn 3040<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
