         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4223
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4224
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3041" id="v3041" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3041" tabindex="-1">v3041</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4225
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wir enmozzen da mit schänden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3042" id="v3042" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3042" tabindex="-1">v3042</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4226
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ersterben uon ir handen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3043" id="v3043" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3043" tabindex="-1">v3043</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4227
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die uns gevserich sint beiden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3044" id="v3044" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3044" tabindex="-1">v3044</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4228
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ez en ruche got scheiden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3045" id="v3045" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3045" tabindex="-1">v3045</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4229
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>anders denne ich waene 3045<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3046" id="v3046" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3046" tabindex="-1">v3046</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4230
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der mich ein die sorgen âne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3047" id="v3047" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3047" tabindex="-1">v3047</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4231
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
