         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4237
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4238
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4239
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3049" id="v3049" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3049" tabindex="-1">v3049</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4240
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Die frôen sprachen im aue zu<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3050" id="v3050" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3050" tabindex="-1">v3050</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4241
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wir sagen dir waz tu tv 3050<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3051" id="v3051" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3051" tabindex="-1">v3051</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4242
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>habe herre uil gute reste<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3052" id="v3052" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3052" tabindex="-1">v3052</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4243
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ist dir nu daz beste<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3053" id="v3053" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3053" tabindex="-1">v3053</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4244
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>untze daz got din angest wende<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3054" id="v3054" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3054" tabindex="-1">v3054</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4245
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν dir sinen trost sende?<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3055" id="v3055" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3055" tabindex="-1">v3055</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4246
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wand giengez uns an daz leben 3055<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3056" id="v3056" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3056" tabindex="-1">v3056</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4247
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so enmsehten wir dir geben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3057" id="v3057" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3057" tabindex="-1">v3057</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4248
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nehêin ende mere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3058" id="v3058" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3058" tabindex="-1">v3058</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4249
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
