         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4250
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der fr5en ofte erschein<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3060" id="v3060" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3060" tabindex="-1">v3060</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4251
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν wrden ensamet ennêin 3060<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3061" id="v3061" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3061" tabindex="-1">v3061</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4252
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wir enwizzen welher tögen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3062" id="v3062" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3062" tabindex="-1">v3062</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4253
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der rede ist unlògen <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3063" id="v3063" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3063" tabindex="-1">v3063</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4254
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>âne in so wart nie dehein man<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3064" id="v3064" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3064" tabindex="-1">v3064</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4255
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der sie ie broehte daran<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3065" id="v3065" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3065" tabindex="-1">v3065</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4256
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie iender uon uns quame 3065<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3066" id="v3066" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3066" tabindex="-1">v3066</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4257
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν iemans wort ueraseme<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3067" id="v3067" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3067" tabindex="-1">v3067</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4258
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der engil gesprah sie dicche<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3068" id="v3068" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3068" tabindex="-1">v3068</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4259
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ze sinem liehtem anplicke<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3069" id="v3069" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3069" tabindex="-1">v3069</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4260
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>frote sih ie div gute<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3070" id="v3070" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3070" tabindex="-1">v3070</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4261
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit reinestoetem mfite 3070<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3071" id="v3071" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3071" tabindex="-1">v3071</a>
