         </span>an den togenlichen rat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3138" id="v3138" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3138" tabindex="-1">v3138</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4404
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sin gute dich erweit hat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3139" id="v3139" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3139" tabindex="-1">v3139</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4405
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nu dien ir mit stsetem mute<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3140" id="v3140" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3140" tabindex="-1">v3140</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4406
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν habes in lieber hüte 3140<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3141" id="v3141" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3141" tabindex="-1">v3141</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4407
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wan der sun den sie bringet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3142" id="v3142" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3142" tabindex="-1">v3142</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4408
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den tievil er betwinget<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
