         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4415
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Iesvs wirt er genant<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3144" id="v3144" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3144" tabindex="-1">v3144</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4416
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz kivt ein heilant<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3145" id="v3145" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3145" tabindex="-1">v3145</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4417
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>5 wand er die werlt haeilet 3145<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3146" id="v3146" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3146" tabindex="-1">v3146</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4418
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div mit sunden ist gemaeilet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3147" id="v3147" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3147" tabindex="-1">v3147</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4419
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uon der helle furet er die<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3148" id="v3148" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3148" tabindex="-1">v3148</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4420
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>di sinen willen taten hie<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3149" id="v3149" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3149" tabindex="-1">v3149</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4421
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der himel ist im undertan<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3150" id="v3150" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3150" tabindex="-1">v3150</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4422
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ze sinem gebot muz er stan 3150<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
