         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4433
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4434
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3151" id="v3151" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3151" tabindex="-1">v3151</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4435
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν allez dazter îe wart<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3152" id="v3152" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3152" tabindex="-1">v3152</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4436
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ist gesegent vnt bewart<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3153" id="v3153" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3153" tabindex="-1">v3153</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4437
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uon siner magenchrefte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3154" id="v3154" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3154" tabindex="-1">v3154</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4438
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν mit der herschefte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3155" id="v3155" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3155" tabindex="-1">v3155</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4439
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die niemen kan uerenden 3155<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
