         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4440
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3156" id="v3156" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3156" tabindex="-1">v3156</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4441
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'dar scholtu din dienest wenden'''<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3157" id="v3157" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3157" tabindex="-1">v3157</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4442
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Ioseph der vil einualte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3158" id="v3158" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3158" tabindex="-1">v3158</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4443
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>niht langer er entwalte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3159" id="v3159" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3159" tabindex="-1">v3159</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4444
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sin frode wart erhaben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3160" id="v3160" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3160" tabindex="-1">v3160</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4445
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sin herze sa entladen 3160<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3161" id="v3161" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3161" tabindex="-1">v3161</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4446
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uon sorgen die er haete<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3162" id="v3162" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3162" tabindex="-1">v3162</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4447
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do bot er sih drate<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3163" id="v3163" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3163" tabindex="-1">v3163</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4448
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>unser froen ze fuzzen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
