         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4453
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4454
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3164" id="v3164" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3164" tabindex="-1">v3164</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4455
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er sprah wie wol mir müzzen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3165" id="v3165" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3165" tabindex="-1">v3165</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4456
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>15 min sunde stan ze rivwe 3165<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3166" id="v3166" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3166" tabindex="-1">v3166</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4457
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ich die missetrivwe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3167" id="v3167" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3167" tabindex="-1">v3167</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4458
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uf dinen lip ie gewan<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3168" id="v3168" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3168" tabindex="-1">v3168</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4459
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>umbe dehein irdisken man<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3169" id="v3169" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3169" tabindex="-1">v3169</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4460
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der engel mich bewiset hat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3170" id="v3170" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3170" tabindex="-1">v3170</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4461
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wie ez umb dih fröe stat 3170<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3171" id="v3171" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3171" tabindex="-1">v3171</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4462
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>du bist ein insigele<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3172" id="v3172" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3172" tabindex="-1">v3172</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4463
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des keisers uz dem himele<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3173" id="v3173" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3173" tabindex="-1">v3173</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4464
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der dih hat gemaehelot<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3174" id="v3174" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3174" tabindex="-1">v3174</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4465
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'durh aller aundasre not'''<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3175" id="v3175" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3175" tabindex="-1">v3175</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4466
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Div m seit sih fröen began 3175<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3176" id="v3176" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3176" tabindex="-1">v3176</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4467
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ir s sel de die sah sie an<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3177" id="v3177" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3177" tabindex="-1">v3177</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4468
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sie wesse wol die gnade frone<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3178" id="v3178" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3178" tabindex="-1">v3178</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4469
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do neik sie im also schone<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3179" id="v3179" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3179" tabindex="-1">v3179</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4470
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der sie geschuof ze den eren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3180" id="v3180" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3180" tabindex="-1">v3180</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4471
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>an sin lop begunde siecheren 3180<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3181" id="v3181" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3181" tabindex="-1">v3181</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4472
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>bediv zunge ν ir sinne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3182" id="v3182" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3182" tabindex="-1">v3182</a>
