         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4473
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sie sprah  ia mak div gotes minne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3183" id="v3183" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3183" tabindex="-1">v3183</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4474
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>an mir wol uolbringen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3184" id="v3184" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3184" tabindex="-1">v3184</a>
