         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4488
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>25 swaz er gebivtet ν wil 3185<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3186" id="v3186" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3186" tabindex="-1">v3186</a>
