         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4496
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>starke lobten sie den heilant<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3190" id="v3190" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3190" tabindex="-1">v3190</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4497
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der sine zeswen hant 3190<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3191" id="v3191" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3191" tabindex="-1">v3191</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4498
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>hete gerihte über sie<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3192" id="v3192" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3192" tabindex="-1">v3192</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4499
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>grozer fròde diu wart nie<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3193" id="v3193" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3193" tabindex="-1">v3193</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4500
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>under einem gesinde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3194" id="v3194" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3194" tabindex="-1">v3194</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4501
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uon der muter v dem kinde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
