         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4505
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>30 div riehen niwe märe 3195<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3196" id="v3196" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3196" tabindex="-1">v3196</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4506
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die musen sie furware<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3197" id="v3197" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3197" tabindex="-1">v3197</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4507
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uor grozer liebe bewêinen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3198" id="v3198" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3198" tabindex="-1">v3198</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4508
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>also waren sie ungeschêiden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
