         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4518
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>witen fur ez ze gazzen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3202" id="v3202" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3202" tabindex="-1">v3202</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4519
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die iuden viengen ze hazze<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3203" id="v3203" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3203" tabindex="-1">v3203</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4520
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div uugewonlichen wort<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3204" id="v3204" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3204" tabindex="-1">v3204</a>
