         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4523
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>iz duhte sie ungefuge genuch<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3207" id="v3207" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3207" tabindex="-1">v3207</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4524
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wand ez e nie wart uernomen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3208" id="v3208" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3208" tabindex="-1">v3208</a>
