         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4529
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do hiezzen sie behalten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3210" id="v3210" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3210" tabindex="-1">v3210</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4530
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die froen ν den alten· 3210<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3211" id="v3211" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3211" tabindex="-1">v3211</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4531
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nntze an den andern morgen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3212" id="v3212" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3212" tabindex="-1">v3212</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
