         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des sie da heten sorgen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3213" id="v3213" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3213" tabindex="-1">v3213</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4533
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz waere in geschadet niht<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3214" id="v3214" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3214" tabindex="-1">v3214</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4534
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ob sie hseten wistûmes iht<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3215" id="v3215" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3215" tabindex="-1">v3215</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4535
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die tumben ewarte 3215<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3216" id="v3216" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3216" tabindex="-1">v3216</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4536
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die erkomen harte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3217" id="v3217" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3217" tabindex="-1">v3217</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4537
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uon der rede do sie erschal<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3218" id="v3218" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3218" tabindex="-1">v3218</a>
