         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4541
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die bisgofe vnt die rihtaere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3220" id="v3220" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3220" tabindex="-1">v3220</a>
