         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4612
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vnt ir herzöge Moisés<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3272" id="v3272" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3272" tabindex="-1">v3272</a>
