         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4678
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der nit uf die vil reine 3330<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3331" id="v3331" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3331" tabindex="-1">v3331</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4679
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do der brunne was gereit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3332" id="v3332" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3332" tabindex="-1">v3332</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4680
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Iosep als daz buch saeit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
