         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4688
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4689
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4690
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4691
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3333" id="v3333" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3333" tabindex="-1">v3333</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4692
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der gerte neheiner friste<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3334" id="v3334" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3334" tabindex="-1">v3334</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4693
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wand in got selbe wiste<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4694
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3335" id="v3335" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3335" tabindex="-1">v3335</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4695
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er drauch ane sorgen darfur 3335<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3336" id="v3336" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3336" tabindex="-1">v3336</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4696
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>erne uorhte niht daz er uerlûr<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4697
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3337" id="v3337" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3337" tabindex="-1">v3337</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4698
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den lip oder sin ere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3338" id="v3338" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3338" tabindex="-1">v3338</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4699
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er gedaht an die lere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3339" id="v3339" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3339" tabindex="-1">v3339</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4700
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die im der engel zusprah<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3340" id="v3340" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3340" tabindex="-1">v3340</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4701
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do er in ivngiste sach 3340<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3341" id="v3341" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3341" tabindex="-1">v3341</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4702
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>diu fröte sinen gedanch<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3342" id="v3342" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3342" tabindex="-1">v3342</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4703
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do hub er uf unt (ranch<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3343" id="v3343" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3343" tabindex="-1">v3343</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4704
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>froliche uor in allen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3344" id="v3344" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3344" tabindex="-1">v3344</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4705
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sie wanten in nider uallen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3345" id="v3345" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3345" tabindex="-1">v3345</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4706
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν uerderben da ze stete 3345<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3346" id="v3346" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3346" tabindex="-1">v3346</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4707
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>iedoh got gnadeklicher tete<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3347" id="v3347" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3347" tabindex="-1">v3347</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4708
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der die sine meiner uerlat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3348" id="v3348" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3348" tabindex="-1">v3348</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4709
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>unt in an den noten bigestat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4710
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4711
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3349" id="v3349" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3349" tabindex="-1">v3349</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4712
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Do stunt er ane wende<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3350" id="v3350" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3350" tabindex="-1">v3350</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4713
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sie fürten in bi der hende 3350<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3351" id="v3351" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3351" tabindex="-1">v3351</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4714
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>umbe den altière sibenstunt<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3352" id="v3352" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3352" tabindex="-1">v3352</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4715
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>dannen schied er wolgesunt<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3353" id="v3353" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3353" tabindex="-1">v3353</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4716
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz nehein urkunde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3354" id="v3354" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3354" tabindex="-1">v3354</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4717
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>luglicher sunde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3355" id="v3355" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3355" tabindex="-1">v3355</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4718
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>an im wart erfunden 3355<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3356" id="v3356" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3356" tabindex="-1">v3356</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4719
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so gnas er uor den hunden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4720
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3357" id="v3357" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3357" tabindex="-1">v3357</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4721
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Nv get ez an unser froven <br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3358" id="v3358" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3358" tabindex="-1">v3358</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4722
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da maht man wol schoen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3359" id="v3359" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3359" tabindex="-1">v3359</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4723
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>spilntiv ögen frien mut<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3360" id="v3360" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3360" tabindex="-1">v3360</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4724
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uon gote was sie so behut 3360<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4725
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3361" id="v3361" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3361" tabindex="-1">v3361</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4726
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>enmitten inme chreizze<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3362" id="v3362" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3362" tabindex="-1">v3362</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4727
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div Scheltwort als heizze<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3363" id="v3363" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3363" tabindex="-1">v3363</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4728
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>diu waren ir sam daz towe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3364" id="v3364" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3364" tabindex="-1">v3364</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4729
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wand sie daz unreht nie gerowe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3365" id="v3365" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3365" tabindex="-1">v3365</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4730
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie mit iemen îe begîe 3365<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3366" id="v3366" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3366" tabindex="-1">v3366</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4731
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ioh den willen gewan sie nie<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4732
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3367" id="v3367" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3367" tabindex="-1">v3367</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4733
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Der bisgof redet samet ir<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3368" id="v3368" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3368" tabindex="-1">v3368</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4734
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die schulde kiesen wir<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3369" id="v3369" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3369" tabindex="-1">v3369</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4735
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>an din selbes libe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3370" id="v3370" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3370" tabindex="-1">v3370</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4736
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sag an wer dich ze wibe 3370<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3371" id="v3371" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3371" tabindex="-1">v3371</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4737
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit schänden habe gemachet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3372" id="v3372" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3372" tabindex="-1">v3372</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4738
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des din oge lachet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3373" id="v3373" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3373" tabindex="-1">v3373</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4739
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des mahtestu baz weinen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3374" id="v3374" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3374" tabindex="-1">v3374</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4740
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>du wirdest ze taeile den stêinen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4741
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4742
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3375" id="v3375" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3375" tabindex="-1">v3375</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4743
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die mistu uor uns liden 3375<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3376" id="v3376" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3376" tabindex="-1">v3376</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4744
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wand sie div e solhen wiben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4745
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3377" id="v3377" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3377" tabindex="-1">v3377</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4746
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>erteilet an den buchen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3378" id="v3378" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3378" tabindex="-1">v3378</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4747
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>du maht uns niht uersuchen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3379" id="v3379" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3379" tabindex="-1">v3379</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4748
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit ualslichem lögen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
