         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4750
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz tu hast gefrûmet tovgen 3380<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3381" id="v3381" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3381" tabindex="-1">v3381</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4751
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
