         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4755
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit senftlichen Worten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3385" id="v3385" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3385" tabindex="-1">v3385</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4756
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>(ja hete sie die zunge 3385<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3386" id="v3386" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3386" tabindex="-1">v3386</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4757
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in suzze rede betwngen)<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3387" id="v3387" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3387" tabindex="-1">v3387</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4758
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sie sprah  ich enhan des niht getan<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3388" id="v3388" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3388" tabindex="-1">v3388</a>
