         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4766
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ich so bin erzundet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3395" id="v3395" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3395" tabindex="-1">v3395</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4767
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit werltlikem vîure 3395<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3396" id="v3396" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3396" tabindex="-1">v3396</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4768
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
