         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4769
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz erz wol mak erzeigen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3398" id="v3398" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3398" tabindex="-1">v3398</a>
