         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>eines buches der began 3515<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3516" id="v3516" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3516" tabindex="-1">v3516</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4954
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da satzet er die ivden an<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3517" id="v3517" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3517" tabindex="-1">v3517</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4955
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν schuf die wirte an scriben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4956
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3518" id="v3518" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3518" tabindex="-1">v3518</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4957
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν di livte dazu triben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3519" id="v3519" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3519" tabindex="-1">v3519</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4958
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie an die chrone drehten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3520" id="v3520" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3520" tabindex="-1">v3520</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4959
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>und ir urkunde brsehten 3520<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4960
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3521" id="v3521" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3521" tabindex="-1">v3521</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4961
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>an dem gelobeten zite<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3522" id="v3522" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3522" tabindex="-1">v3522</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4962
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uber die lantschaft wite<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3523" id="v3523" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3523" tabindex="-1">v3523</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4963
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nieman was so mahtich<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3524" id="v3524" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3524" tabindex="-1">v3524</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4964
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so riche noh so ahtich<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3525" id="v3525" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3525" tabindex="-1">v3525</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4965
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>erne mvse den zins geben 3525<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3526" id="v3526" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3526" tabindex="-1">v3526</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4966
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den frone hört erheben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3527" id="v3527" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3527" tabindex="-1">v3527</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4967
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν den kamerschatze meren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
