         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4974
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4975
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3529" id="v3529" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3529" tabindex="-1">v3529</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4976
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die da uz waren gevarn<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3530" id="v3530" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3530" tabindex="-1">v3530</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4977
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die ilten heim daz bewarn 3530<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3531" id="v3531" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3531" tabindex="-1">v3531</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4978
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie iht beliben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3532" id="v3532" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3532" tabindex="-1">v3532</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4979
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sine wrden angescriben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3533" id="v3533" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3533" tabindex="-1">v3533</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4980
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>zu ir chunne ν ir magen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3534" id="v3534" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3534" tabindex="-1">v3534</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4981
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da si oh daz silber gaben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
