         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4988
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3535" id="v3535" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3535" tabindex="-1">v3535</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4989
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz drie pfenninge wach 3535<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3536" id="v3536" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3536" tabindex="-1">v3536</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4990
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so ez uf der wage gelach<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3537" id="v3537" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3537" tabindex="-1">v3537</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4991
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz gap ein ieglich man<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3538" id="v3538" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3538" tabindex="-1">v3538</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4992
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der daz leben wolte han<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3539" id="v3539" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3539" tabindex="-1">v3539</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4993
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die sich beguuden werben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3540" id="v3540" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3540" tabindex="-1">v3540</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4994
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die erslugen die schergen 3540<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3541" id="v3541" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3541" tabindex="-1">v3541</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4995
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die daz gelt enpfiengen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3542" id="v3542" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3542" tabindex="-1">v3542</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4996
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν fur die fursten gieugen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3543" id="v3543" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3543" tabindex="-1">v3543</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v4997
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
