         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5000
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν geladen mule<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3547" id="v3547" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3547" tabindex="-1">v3547</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5001
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν wâgene also ueste<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3548" id="v3548" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3548" tabindex="-1">v3548</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5002
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die daz gesmide beste<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
