         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5012
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>done was dehein her<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3553" id="v3553" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3553" tabindex="-1">v3553</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5013
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz îender des gedsehte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3554" id="v3554" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3554" tabindex="-1">v3554</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5014
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ez strite oder usehte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
