         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3555" id="v3555" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3555" tabindex="-1">v3555</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5017
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>done was niht urlivge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3556" id="v3556" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3556" tabindex="-1">v3556</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5018
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>bi des meres pîvge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3557" id="v3557" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3557" tabindex="-1">v3557</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5019
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>noh ««hein nit geschelle<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3558" id="v3558" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3558" tabindex="-1">v3558</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5020
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit grozer ebenhelle<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3559" id="v3559" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3559" tabindex="-1">v3559</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5021
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
