         </span>div senfte ν diu stille<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3562" id="v3562" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3562" tabindex="-1">v3562</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5024
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div was des kindes wille<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3563" id="v3563" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3563" tabindex="-1">v3563</a>
