         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz wir ân frseise gedingen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3625" id="v3625" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3625" tabindex="-1">v3625</a>
