         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5228
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν da zinsen schölten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3708" id="v3708" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3708" tabindex="-1">v3708</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5229
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des selben heten sie wan<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3709" id="v3709" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3709" tabindex="-1">v3709</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5230
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν sahen in gerne mit in gan 3710<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3710" id="v3710" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3710" tabindex="-1">v3710</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5231
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do taten sie rede genüge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3711" id="v3711" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3711" tabindex="-1">v3711</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5232
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>also sózze ν gefnge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3712" id="v3712" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3712" tabindex="-1">v3712</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5233
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uon der naheten herschaft<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3713" id="v3713" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3713" tabindex="-1">v3713</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5234
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>von gotes gute ν sirier chraft<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3714" id="v3714" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3714" tabindex="-1">v3714</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5235
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span> ir herze waren reine 3715<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3715" id="v3715" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3715" tabindex="-1">v3715</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5236
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in rehter minne gemeine<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3716" id="v3716" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3716" tabindex="-1">v3716</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5237
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Do sprah der iungelinch<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3717" id="v3717" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3717" tabindex="-1">v3717</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5238
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ich horte wol daz taeidinch<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3718" id="v3718" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3718" tabindex="-1">v3718</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5239
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz e was under iv<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3719" id="v3719" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3719" tabindex="-1">v3719</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5240
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do ich chom gegangen zu iv 3720<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3720" id="v3720" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3720" tabindex="-1">v3720</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5241
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uon den gwaltigen tôgen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3721" id="v3721" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3721" tabindex="-1">v3721</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5242
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div maehte Ioseph wol getöben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3722" id="v3722" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3722" tabindex="-1">v3722</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5243
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sin sin fremdliche stat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3723" id="v3723" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3723" tabindex="-1">v3723</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5244
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ze den dingen die got hat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3724" id="v3724" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3724" tabindex="-1">v3724</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5245
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ûf dem wege bescheinet 3725<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3725" id="v3725" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3725" tabindex="-1">v3725</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5246
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz en weiz ich waz meinet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5247
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5248
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5249
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5250
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5251
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5252
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5253
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3726" id="v3726" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3726" tabindex="-1">v3726</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5254
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Ioseph höre herze mir<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3727" id="v3727" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3727" tabindex="-1">v3727</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5255
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die warheit sage ich dir<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3728" id="v3728" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3728" tabindex="-1">v3728</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5256
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ze divte an disen stunden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5257
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3729" id="v3729" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3729" tabindex="-1">v3729</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5258
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die die hende so wnden 3730<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3730" id="v3730" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3730" tabindex="-1">v3730</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5259
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν angestliche gebarten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5260
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3731" id="v3731" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3731" tabindex="-1">v3731</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5261
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die habent die wingarten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3732" id="v3732" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3732" tabindex="-1">v3732</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5262
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>gotes niht erbuwen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3733" id="v3733" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3733" tabindex="-1">v3733</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5263
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz muz sie balde riwen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3734" id="v3734" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3734" tabindex="-1">v3734</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5264
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ist div iudiske diet 3735<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3735" id="v3735" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3735" tabindex="-1">v3735</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5265
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div die wissagen uerriet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3736" id="v3736" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3736" tabindex="-1">v3736</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5266
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die in da waren gesant<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3737" id="v3737" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3737" tabindex="-1">v3737</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5267
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uon des oberisten hant<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3738" id="v3738" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3738" tabindex="-1">v3738</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5268
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die habent vil grimmigez mut<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3739" id="v3739" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3739" tabindex="-1">v3739</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5269
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz vil unschuldige blut 3740<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3740" id="v3740" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3740" tabindex="-1">v3740</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5270
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ist hinze in gerunnen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3741" id="v3741" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3741" tabindex="-1">v3741</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5271
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sie sint dem hirte entrunnen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3742" id="v3742" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3742" tabindex="-1">v3742</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5272
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>19430 mit dem si genesen schölten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5273
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3743" id="v3743" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3743" tabindex="-1">v3743</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5274
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ob siz dienen wolten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3744" id="v3744" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3744" tabindex="-1">v3744</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5275
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ir ubele hat in uerteilet 3745<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3745" id="v3745" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3745" tabindex="-1">v3745</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5276
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des gent sie geseilet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5277
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3746" id="v3746" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3746" tabindex="-1">v3746</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5278
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit vivrinen banden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3747" id="v3747" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3747" tabindex="-1">v3747</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5279
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in noten ν grozzen schänden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5280
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3748" id="v3748" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3748" tabindex="-1">v3748</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5281
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sint sie iemer bestricket<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3749" id="v3749" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3749" tabindex="-1">v3749</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5282
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ir ere div ist genicket 3750<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3750" id="v3750" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3750" tabindex="-1">v3750</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5283
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν berihtet sih nîenmere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3751" id="v3751" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3751" tabindex="-1">v3751</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5284
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des chlageten sie also sere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5285
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5286
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3752" id="v3752" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3752" tabindex="-1">v3752</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5287
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Die anderhalp da fròde hant<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3753" id="v3753" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3753" tabindex="-1">v3753</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5288
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν in liehter wate stant<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5289
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3754" id="v3754" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3754" tabindex="-1">v3754</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5290
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sint die becherten 3755<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3755" id="v3755" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3755" tabindex="-1">v3755</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5291
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die got wilen êrten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5292
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3756" id="v3756" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3756" tabindex="-1">v3756</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5293
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die enpfahent nü gotes svn<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3757" id="v3757" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3757" tabindex="-1">v3757</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5294
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der in sin gnade wil tun<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3758" id="v3758" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3758" tabindex="-1">v3758</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5295
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die belibent niht ze der winster<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3759" id="v3759" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3759" tabindex="-1">v3759</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5296
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
