         </span>Div froe entwêlen muse<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3817" id="v3817" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3817" tabindex="-1">v3817</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5365
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>bi einer smoehen chiuse<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3818" id="v3818" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3818" tabindex="-1">v3818</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5366
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>diu himiliske porte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3819" id="v3819" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3819" tabindex="-1">v3819</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5367
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die got mit sinem worte 3820<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3820" id="v3820" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3820" tabindex="-1">v3820</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5368
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>erweit uns ze heile<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
