         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5370
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3821" id="v3821" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3821" tabindex="-1">v3821</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5371
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>diu gesah in einem stêine<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3822" id="v3822" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3822" tabindex="-1">v3822</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5372
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ein vil wenigez lfich<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3823" id="v3823" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3823" tabindex="-1">v3823</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5373
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ir wille sie dar getruch<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3824" id="v3824" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3824" tabindex="-1">v3824</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5374
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie dar in trat 3825<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3825" id="v3825" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3825" tabindex="-1">v3825</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5375
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν sich da hete gesät<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
