         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5377
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz enchom niht uon geschihte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3827" id="v3827" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3827" tabindex="-1">v3827</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5378
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie in alrihte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3828" id="v3828" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3828" tabindex="-1">v3828</a>
