         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5379
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in dem vinsteren hol<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3829" id="v3829" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3829" tabindex="-1">v3829</a>
