         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5383
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uor gescriben ν gesaget<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3833" id="v3833" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3833" tabindex="-1">v3833</a>
