         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5390
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do sie gie in den stêin<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3839" id="v3839" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3839" tabindex="-1">v3839</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5391
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do luhte ν erschêin 3840<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3840" id="v3840" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3840" tabindex="-1">v3840</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5392
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ein michel lieht dar inne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3841" id="v3841" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3841" tabindex="-1">v3841</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5393
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>gegen der kuniginne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3842" id="v3842" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3842" tabindex="-1">v3842</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5394
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die wile daz sie da beleib<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3843" id="v3843" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3843" tabindex="-1">v3843</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5395
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
