         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν swar sie in wolte senden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3867" id="v3867" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3867" tabindex="-1">v3867</a>
