         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5439
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die taten sie sorgen vrî<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v3876" id="v3876" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v3876" tabindex="-1">v3876</a>
