         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5780
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4093" id="v4093" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4093" tabindex="-1">v4093</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5781
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν mit liebe sungen sie do<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4094" id="v4094" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4094" tabindex="-1">v4094</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5782
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'Gloria in excelsis deo'' 4095'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4095" id="v4095" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4095" tabindex="-1">v4095</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5783
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Die hirte redeten under in<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4096" id="v4096" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4096" tabindex="-1">v4096</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5784
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wir schulen den unsern sin<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4097" id="v4097" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4097" tabindex="-1">v4097</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5785
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>cheren hince Christe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4098" id="v4098" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4098" tabindex="-1">v4098</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5786
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wie zseme uns dehein friste?<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5787
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4099" id="v4099" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4099" tabindex="-1">v4099</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5788
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz uns der engel hat gesaget 4100<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4100" id="v4100" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4100" tabindex="-1">v4100</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5789
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uon dem kinde ν der maget<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4101" id="v4101" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4101" tabindex="-1">v4101</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5790
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz schvlen wir gerne sehen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4102" id="v4102" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4102" tabindex="-1">v4102</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5791
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν gote oh beiehen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4103" id="v4103" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4103" tabindex="-1">v4103</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5792
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'siner manchualten wnder'''<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
