         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5800
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>enuêin wrden sie dar under 4105<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4105" id="v4105" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4105" tabindex="-1">v4105</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5801
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ob in Davidis purge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4106" id="v4106" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4106" tabindex="-1">v4106</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5802
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz zeichen funden wrde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4107" id="v4107" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4107" tabindex="-1">v4107</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5803
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so schölte sie wol gelüsten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4108" id="v4108" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4108" tabindex="-1">v4108</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5804
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie daz tuch chusten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4109" id="v4109" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4109" tabindex="-1">v4109</a>
