         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5874
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4131" id="v4131" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4131" tabindex="-1">v4131</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5875
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>manige riche kunige<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4132" id="v4132" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4132" tabindex="-1">v4132</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5876
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν herzogen frumige<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4133" id="v4133" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4133" tabindex="-1">v4133</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5877
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die herliche lebeten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4134" id="v4134" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4134" tabindex="-1">v4134</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5878
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>τ (in) den eren swebeten 4135<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
