         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5880
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den santer niht den engel sin<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4136" id="v4136" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4136" tabindex="-1">v4136</a>
