         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5882
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz nîemen ist so arme<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4138" id="v4138" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4138" tabindex="-1">v4138</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5883
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der sin zuhte wil bewarne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4139" id="v4139" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4139" tabindex="-1">v4139</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5884
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>30 so nider noch so ringe 4140<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4140" id="v4140" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4140" tabindex="-1">v4140</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5885
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>stat der sin gedinge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4141" id="v4141" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4141" tabindex="-1">v4141</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5886
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>naste an unsern trehtin<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4142" id="v4142" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4142" tabindex="-1">v4142</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5887
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er möze im willekomen sin<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
