         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5891
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>niemen im uersmahet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4144" id="v4144" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4144" tabindex="-1">v4144</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5892
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der zu ime gahet 4145<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4145" id="v4145" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4145" tabindex="-1">v4145</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5893
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>? die sunde durh in lat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4146" id="v4146" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4146" tabindex="-1">v4146</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5894
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der uindet 5h hilfe ν rat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4147" id="v4147" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4147" tabindex="-1">v4147</a>
