         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5896
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>35 an dem mennisken got nîen schivhet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4149" id="v4149" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4149" tabindex="-1">v4149</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5897
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wân ung&amp;te V unreht 4150<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4150" id="v4150" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4150" tabindex="-1">v4150</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5898
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ieglich guter ist sin chneht<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4151" id="v4151" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4151" tabindex="-1">v4151</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5899
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der diemutez herze treit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4152" id="v4152" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4152" tabindex="-1">v4152</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5900
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>dem ist sin gnade bereit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4153" id="v4153" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4153" tabindex="-1">v4153</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5901
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er ist oh der beste hirte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4154" id="v4154" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4154" tabindex="-1">v4154</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5902
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des schàf der raezze wolf uerbirte 4155<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4155" id="v4155" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4155" tabindex="-1">v4155</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5903
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wan er sie beschermen mik<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4156" id="v4156" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4156" tabindex="-1">v4156</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5904
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
