         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5905
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nor aller slahte leide<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4158" id="v4158" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4158" tabindex="-1">v4158</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5906
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν git die ewigen weide<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4159" id="v4159" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4159" tabindex="-1">v4159</a>
