         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5930
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er ist der steine vil here<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4169" id="v4169" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4169" tabindex="-1">v4169</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5931
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der ane mennisken hant 4170<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4170" id="v4170" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4170" tabindex="-1">v4170</a>
