         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5942
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sin gewalt so groz zallen stunden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4179" id="v4179" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4179" tabindex="-1">v4179</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5943
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
