         </span>ν hien erde was geborn<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4219" id="v4219" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4219" tabindex="-1">v4219</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v5989
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
