         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der uon rehte daz wol weiz<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4222" id="v4222" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4222" tabindex="-1">v4222</a>
