         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6057
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4272" id="v4272" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4272" tabindex="-1">v4272</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6058
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do Christ wart geborn<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4273" id="v4273" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4273" tabindex="-1">v4273</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6059
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do was ir antwerch uerlorn<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4274" id="v4274" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4274" tabindex="-1">v4274</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6060
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>diu sule sich do zarte 4275<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4275" id="v4275" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4275" tabindex="-1">v4275</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6061
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz nîemen des gewarte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6062
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4276" id="v4276" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4276" tabindex="-1">v4276</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6063
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>untze sie en allen gahen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4277" id="v4277" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4277" tabindex="-1">v4277</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6064
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ir meister uallen sahen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4278" id="v4278" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4278" tabindex="-1">v4278</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6065
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>michel wart daz chrachen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4279" id="v4279" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4279" tabindex="-1">v4279</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6066
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>diu livte musen wachen 4280<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4280" id="v4280" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4280" tabindex="-1">v4280</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6067
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uon dem slage sie erchomen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4281" id="v4281" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4281" tabindex="-1">v4281</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6068
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>erschuttei wart do Rome<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4282" id="v4282" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4282" tabindex="-1">v4282</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6069
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uon der alten trugheit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4283" id="v4283" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4283" tabindex="-1">v4283</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6070
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>got wolte mit der warheit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4284" id="v4284" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4284" tabindex="-1">v4284</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6071
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den stuole selbe reinen 4285<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4285" id="v4285" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4285" tabindex="-1">v4285</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6072
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν zaigete daz man in einen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4286" id="v4286" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4286" tabindex="-1">v4286</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6073
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ze gote erchennen schölte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4287" id="v4287" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4287" tabindex="-1">v4287</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6074
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>als der tieuil do uerdolte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4288" id="v4288" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4288" tabindex="-1">v4288</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6075
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den slach uon himel so grozzen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4289" id="v4289" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4289" tabindex="-1">v4289</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6076
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er für ze sinen genozzen 4290<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4290" id="v4290" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4290" tabindex="-1">v4290</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6077
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sa uerstozzen in die helle<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4291" id="v4291" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4291" tabindex="-1">v4291</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6078
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit vil wêlichem geschelle<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4292" id="v4292" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4292" tabindex="-1">v4292</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6079
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da ist er gebunden sere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6080
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6081
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6082
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6083
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4293" id="v4293" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4293" tabindex="-1">v4293</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6084
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz er niemer mere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4294" id="v4294" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4294" tabindex="-1">v4294</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6085
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>her uz mak gerseichen  4295<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4295" id="v4295" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4295" tabindex="-1">v4295</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6086
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ist daz dritte zêichen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4296" id="v4296" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4296" tabindex="-1">v4296</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6087
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Daz fierde wnder daz was<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4297" id="v4297" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4297" tabindex="-1">v4297</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6088
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>diu michel unanimitas<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4298" id="v4298" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4298" tabindex="-1">v4298</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6089
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>aller fride meiste<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4299" id="v4299" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4299" tabindex="-1">v4299</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6090
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit des keisers uolleiste 4300<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4300" id="v4300" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4300" tabindex="-1">v4300</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6091
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der wart erhaben ν gesworn<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4301" id="v4301" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4301" tabindex="-1">v4301</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6092
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do Christ was geborn<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4302" id="v4302" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4302" tabindex="-1">v4302</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6093
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>an dem tage vil heren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4303" id="v4303" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4303" tabindex="-1">v4303</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6094
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da wolter uns mit leren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4304" id="v4304" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4304" tabindex="-1">v4304</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6095
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz er der ware fride si 4305<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4305" id="v4305" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4305" tabindex="-1">v4305</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6096
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da wir gnade uinden bi<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4306" id="v4306" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4306" tabindex="-1">v4306</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6097
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>35 ν der uns sicher mache<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4307" id="v4307" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4307" tabindex="-1">v4307</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6098
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>von allem ungemache<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4308" id="v4308" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4308" tabindex="-1">v4308</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6099
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν uon des tievils gewalte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4309" id="v4309" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4309" tabindex="-1">v4309</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6100
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des hohfart er ualte 4310<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4310" id="v4310" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4310" tabindex="-1">v4310</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6101
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit siner geintote<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4311" id="v4311" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4311" tabindex="-1">v4311</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6102
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν der mêide geburte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6103
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6104
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6105
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6106
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6107
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6108
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6109
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4312" id="v4312" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4312" tabindex="-1">v4312</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6110
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uns kom fride guter<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4313" id="v4313" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4313" tabindex="-1">v4313</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6111
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do diu reine muter<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4314" id="v4314" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4314" tabindex="-1">v4314</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6112
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den sun umbevîe 4315<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4315" id="v4315" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4315" tabindex="-1">v4315</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6113
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der den ubeln tot niht enlie<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4316" id="v4316" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4316" tabindex="-1">v4316</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6114
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>40 so uaste richsen als e<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4317" id="v4317" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4317" tabindex="-1">v4317</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6115
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>dennoh brahter uns sselden me<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4318" id="v4318" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4318" tabindex="-1">v4318</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6116
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ist daz ewige leben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4319" id="v4319" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4319" tabindex="-1">v4319</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6117
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz er den sinen wil geben 4320<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6118
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4320" id="v4320" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4320" tabindex="-1">v4320</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6119
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Augustus aue gedahte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6120
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4321" id="v4321" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4321" tabindex="-1">v4321</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6121
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>an der heren Christes nahte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4322" id="v4322" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4322" tabindex="-1">v4322</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6122
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>waz siner chrone tohte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4323" id="v4323" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4323" tabindex="-1">v4323</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6123
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν mit weihen dingen er mohte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4324" id="v4324" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4324" tabindex="-1">v4324</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6124
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sinen gwalt erzaigen mit gute 4325<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4325" id="v4325" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4325" tabindex="-1">v4325</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6125
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν sin tugentriche gemute<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6126
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4326" id="v4326" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4326" tabindex="-1">v4326</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6127
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in sinem gezelt er lach<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4327" id="v4327" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4327" tabindex="-1">v4327</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6128
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>keiserliche als er pflach<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4328" id="v4328" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4328" tabindex="-1">v4328</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6129
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>5 do fröt er sich der riche<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4329" id="v4329" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4329" tabindex="-1">v4329</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6130
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div im dienten uorhtliche 4330<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4330" id="v4330" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4330" tabindex="-1">v4330</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6131
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν der manigen lande<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4331" id="v4331" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4331" tabindex="-1">v4331</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6132
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div da in siner hande<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4332" id="v4332" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4332" tabindex="-1">v4332</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6133
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>stunden ane widerstrit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4333" id="v4333" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4333" tabindex="-1">v4333</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6134
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wand nie uordes noh danah sit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4334" id="v4334" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4334" tabindex="-1">v4334</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6135
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wart dehein keiser so máre 4335<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4335" id="v4335" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4335" tabindex="-1">v4335</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6136
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>dem elliv div werlt wäre<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6137
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
