         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6139
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4336" id="v4336" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4336" tabindex="-1">v4336</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6140
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ensamet undertan<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4337" id="v4337" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4337" tabindex="-1">v4337</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6141
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wie diu schölte gestan<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4338" id="v4338" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4338" tabindex="-1">v4338</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6142
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>10 daz muser besorgen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4339" id="v4339" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4339" tabindex="-1">v4339</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6143
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>an dem selben morgen 4340<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4340" id="v4340" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4340" tabindex="-1">v4340</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6144
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do was er worden ennein<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4341" id="v4341" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4341" tabindex="-1">v4341</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6145
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da wol sin tugent anschêin<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4342" id="v4342" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4342" tabindex="-1">v4342</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6146
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz alle die der waeren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4343" id="v4343" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4343" tabindex="-1">v4343</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6147
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>witen in den charchseren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4344" id="v4344" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4344" tabindex="-1">v4344</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6148
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>geuangen y gebunden 4345<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4345" id="v4345" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4345" tabindex="-1">v4345</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6149
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die gedingen nîen chunden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
