         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6151
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6152
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4346" id="v4346" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4346" tabindex="-1">v4346</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6153
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Christ wolte dabi<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4347" id="v4347" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4347" tabindex="-1">v4347</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6154
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>15 sih selben lan erchennen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4348" id="v4348" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4348" tabindex="-1">v4348</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6155
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν sin goteheit nennen 4350<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6156
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4349" id="v4349" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4349" tabindex="-1">v4349</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6157
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der magede sun sûzze<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4350" id="v4350" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4350" tabindex="-1">v4350</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6158
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit gnadeklichem grnzze<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6159
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4351" id="v4351" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4351" tabindex="-1">v4351</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6160
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>chom er sinen kinden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4352" id="v4352" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4352" tabindex="-1">v4352</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6161
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er hiez sie abebinden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4353" id="v4353" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4353" tabindex="-1">v4353</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6162
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die cheten also swâre 4355<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4354" id="v4354" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4354" tabindex="-1">v4354</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6163
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da ze dem hellecharchére<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4355" id="v4355" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4355" tabindex="-1">v4355</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6164
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die siner hilfe îe baten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4356" id="v4356" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4356" tabindex="-1">v4356</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6165
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>y sin gebiten haten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4357" id="v4357" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4357" tabindex="-1">v4357</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6166
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>20 er loste sie mit siner chumfte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
