         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6169
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4358" id="v4358" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4358" tabindex="-1">v4358</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6170
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz zeichen was daz fünfte 4360<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4359" id="v4359" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4359" tabindex="-1">v4359</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6171
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Daz sehste schult ir hören<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4360" id="v4360" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4360" tabindex="-1">v4360</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6172
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit willigen oren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4361" id="v4361" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4361" tabindex="-1">v4361</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6173
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz zeiget oh hince got<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
