         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4362" id="v4362" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4362" tabindex="-1">v4362</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6176
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Augustus aue gebot<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4363" id="v4363" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4363" tabindex="-1">v4363</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6177
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>über elliu siniv riche 4365<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4364" id="v4364" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4364" tabindex="-1">v4364</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6178
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die ir herren frauelliche<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
