         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6181
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4365" id="v4365" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4365" tabindex="-1">v4365</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6182
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wären entrunnen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4366" id="v4366" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4366" tabindex="-1">v4366</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6183
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz die alle wider sunnen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4367" id="v4367" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4367" tabindex="-1">v4367</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6184
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>2δ ν daz sie ftruen sûne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
