         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6186
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ze ir rehtem hertûme 4370<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4369" id="v4369" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4369" tabindex="-1">v4369</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6187
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die daz gebot zebrachen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4370" id="v4370" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4370" tabindex="-1">v4370</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6188
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν die uolge uersprachen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4371" id="v4371" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4371" tabindex="-1">v4371</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6189
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die musen liden grozze not<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4372" id="v4372" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4372" tabindex="-1">v4372</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6190
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in wart ertaeilet der tot<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
