         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6198
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die daz niht gelopten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4377" id="v4377" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4377" tabindex="-1">v4377</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6199
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
