         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6202
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz bezeichent die uerworhten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4380" id="v4380" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4380" tabindex="-1">v4380</a>
