         </span>non dem nivwen kinde 4515<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4514" id="v4514" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4514" tabindex="-1">v4514</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6400
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν dem sterne der in luhte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4515" id="v4515" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4515" tabindex="-1">v4515</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6401
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der kunik enpfieng ez swinde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4516" id="v4516" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4516" tabindex="-1">v4516</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6402
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>20 div rede in fremde duhte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4517" id="v4517" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4517" tabindex="-1">v4517</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6403
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>al der hof erchom ioh div stat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4518" id="v4518" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4518" tabindex="-1">v4518</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6404
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der herre sie aue bat 4520<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4519" id="v4519" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4519" tabindex="-1">v4519</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6405
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie im furbaz saeiten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4520" id="v4520" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4520" tabindex="-1">v4520</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6406
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν der warheit bereiten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4521" id="v4521" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4521" tabindex="-1">v4521</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6407
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nmbe daz kiut so here<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4522" id="v4522" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4522" tabindex="-1">v4522</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6408
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des name gwalt ν ere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4523" id="v4523" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4523" tabindex="-1">v4523</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6409
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so chreftick schölte sin 4525<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4524" id="v4524" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4524" tabindex="-1">v4524</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6410
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wie in daz wfère worden schin<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6411
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6412
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6413
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6414
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6415
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6416
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6417
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6418
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6419
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6420
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4525" id="v4525" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4525" tabindex="-1">v4525</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6421
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Die herren im antwrten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4526" id="v4526" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4526" tabindex="-1">v4526</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6422
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit zuhtlichen Worten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6423
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6424
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6425
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4527" id="v4527" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4527" tabindex="-1">v4527</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6426
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wir suchen daz selbe kint<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4528" id="v4528" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4528" tabindex="-1">v4528</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6427
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>durh daz untir ime sint 4530<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4529" id="v4529" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4529" tabindex="-1">v4529</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6428
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>bediv engel ν liute<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4530" id="v4530" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4530" tabindex="-1">v4530</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6429
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz zaeiget er wol ze dûte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4531" id="v4531" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4531" tabindex="-1">v4531</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6430
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ir meget ez hören gerne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6431
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6432
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4532" id="v4532" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4532" tabindex="-1">v4532</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6433
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>non himel chom ein sterne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4533" id="v4533" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4533" tabindex="-1">v4533</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6434
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da wir waren alle dri 4535<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4534" id="v4534" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4534" tabindex="-1">v4534</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6435
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so michel Schönheit was im bi<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4535" id="v4535" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4535" tabindex="-1">v4535</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6436
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>30 daz sie niemen furbringen mach<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4536" id="v4536" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4536" tabindex="-1">v4536</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6437
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do gfranen wir lieben tach<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4537" id="v4537" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4537" tabindex="-1">v4537</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6438
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wände wir an den stunden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4538" id="v4538" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4538" tabindex="-1">v4538</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6439
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uoii gotes gute erfunden 4540<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4539" id="v4539" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4539" tabindex="-1">v4539</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6440
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>waz daz wnder mêinte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4540" id="v4540" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4540" tabindex="-1">v4540</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6441
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div schrift uns daz besehêinte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4541" id="v4541" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4541" tabindex="-1">v4541</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6442
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>35 wie daz zeichen scholt erschineu<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4542" id="v4542" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4542" tabindex="-1">v4542</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6443
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so Ohrist heilant den sinen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4543" id="v4543" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4543" tabindex="-1">v4543</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6444
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ze helfe wolte chomen 4545<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4544" id="v4544" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4544" tabindex="-1">v4544</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6445
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>also heten wirz uernomen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4545" id="v4545" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4545" tabindex="-1">v4545</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6446
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do wrden wir ze rate<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4546" id="v4546" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4546" tabindex="-1">v4546</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6447
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz wir strichen drate<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4547" id="v4547" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4547" tabindex="-1">v4547</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6448
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die herschaft ze suchen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4548" id="v4548" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4548" tabindex="-1">v4548</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6449
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>V ob sin got wil geruchen 4550<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4549" id="v4549" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4549" tabindex="-1">v4549</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6450
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so mugen wir niht erwinden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4550" id="v4550" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4550" tabindex="-1">v4550</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6451
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vutze wir die heiniut vinden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4551" id="v4551" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4551" tabindex="-1">v4551</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6452
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die daz kint besezzen hat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4552" id="v4552" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4552" tabindex="-1">v4552</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6453
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>dem al div werlt ze dienste stat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4553" id="v4553" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4553" tabindex="-1">v4553</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6454
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sin sterne unser wisel wart 4555<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4554" id="v4554" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4554" tabindex="-1">v4554</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6455
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν gab uns froliche uart<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6456
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6457
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6458
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6459
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4555" id="v4555" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4555" tabindex="-1">v4555</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6460
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nutze her an daz burgetor<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4556" id="v4556" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4556" tabindex="-1">v4556</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6461
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da entwêich er uns uor<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4557" id="v4557" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4557" tabindex="-1">v4557</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6462
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do gedingeten wir zware<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4558" id="v4558" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4558" tabindex="-1">v4558</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6463
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz unser heil hie wsere 4560<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4559" id="v4559" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4559" tabindex="-1">v4559</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6464
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν ôh hie wrden gewert<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4560" id="v4560" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4560" tabindex="-1">v4560</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6465
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des unser herze sere gert<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4561" id="v4561" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4561" tabindex="-1">v4561</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6466
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wir wolten daz kint eren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4562" id="v4562" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4562" tabindex="-1">v4562</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6467
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>v sinen gewalt uil heren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4563" id="v4563" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4563" tabindex="-1">v4563</a>
