         </span>v erkvb ir herze so 4615<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4614" id="v4614" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4614" tabindex="-1">v4614</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6537
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie wrden starche fro<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4615" id="v4615" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4615" tabindex="-1">v4615</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6538
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν lobeten gotes togen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4616" id="v4616" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4616" tabindex="-1">v4616</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6539
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div sie sahen mit ir 5gen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4617" id="v4617" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4617" tabindex="-1">v4617</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6540
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sus brahte sie ir wîsel dar<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4618" id="v4618" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4618" tabindex="-1">v4618</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6541
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der liehte ν wolgevar 4620<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4619" id="v4619" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4619" tabindex="-1">v4619</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6542
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν gestunt da ze stet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4620" id="v4620" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4620" tabindex="-1">v4620</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6543
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>damit er in ze wise tet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4621" id="v4621" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4621" tabindex="-1">v4621</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6544
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie furbaz nîen schölten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4622" id="v4622" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4622" tabindex="-1">v4622</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6545
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ob sie got eren wolten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4623" id="v4623" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4623" tabindex="-1">v4623</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6546
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die fursten in daz hus draten 4ß25<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4624" id="v4624" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4624" tabindex="-1">v4624</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6547
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit ir opfer daz sie haten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4625" id="v4625" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4625" tabindex="-1">v4625</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6548
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uon richem willen bereit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4626" id="v4626" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4626" tabindex="-1">v4626</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6549
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>fur daz kint ν die meit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4627" id="v4627" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4627" tabindex="-1">v4627</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6550
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vielen sie herzekliche<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4628" id="v4628" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4628" tabindex="-1">v4628</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6551
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ir mut was uerstantliche 4630<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4629" id="v4629" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4629" tabindex="-1">v4629</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6552
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>want den sie mennisken sahen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4630" id="v4630" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4630" tabindex="-1">v4630</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6553
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der gotheit sie im iahen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4631" id="v4631" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4631" tabindex="-1">v4631</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6554
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν daz sie ane meil waere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4632" id="v4632" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4632" tabindex="-1">v4632</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6555
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>diu in mñter gebsere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
