         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6572
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6573
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6574
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4633" id="v4633" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4633" tabindex="-1">v4633</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6575
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der eine truch in der hant 4635<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4634" id="v4634" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4634" tabindex="-1">v4634</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6576
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die goltmassen wolgebrant<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4635" id="v4635" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4635" tabindex="-1">v4635</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6577
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>damit bedûter die chraft<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4636" id="v4636" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4636" tabindex="-1">v4636</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6578
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν die keiserlichen hersckaft<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4637" id="v4637" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4637" tabindex="-1">v4637</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6579
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die der kunich aller kunige hat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4638" id="v4638" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4638" tabindex="-1">v4638</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6580
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>dem daz golt wol ze mazze stat 4640<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4639" id="v4639" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4639" tabindex="-1">v4639</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6581
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
