         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6585
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz er got wsere ν ewart<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4642" id="v4642" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4642" tabindex="-1">v4642</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6586
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der al die Werlte bewart<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4643" id="v4643" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4643" tabindex="-1">v4643</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6587
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der dritte mirren darbot 4645<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4644" id="v4644" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4644" tabindex="-1">v4644</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6588
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>damit urkundet er den tot<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4645" id="v4645" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4645" tabindex="-1">v4645</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6589
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den er sit an dem cruce leit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4646" id="v4646" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4646" tabindex="-1">v4646</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6590
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ia was do ein gewonheit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4647" id="v4647" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4647" tabindex="-1">v4647</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6591
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz man toten mit mirren behielt<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4648" id="v4648" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4648" tabindex="-1">v4648</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6592
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ire dehein fûle wîelt 4650<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4649" id="v4649" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4649" tabindex="-1">v4649</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
