         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6596
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des kindes herschaft moere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4653" id="v4653" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4653" tabindex="-1">v4653</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6597
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sin gotliche gute 4655<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4654" id="v4654" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4654" tabindex="-1">v4654</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6598
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν des todes diemute<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4655" id="v4655" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4655" tabindex="-1">v4655</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
