         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6616
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ir den kunichiftí me sehet 4665<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4664" id="v4664" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4664" tabindex="-1">v4664</a>
