         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6697
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>hinze chirchen ir sun<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4696" id="v4696" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4696" tabindex="-1">v4696</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6698
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>als div e gebot ze tûn<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
