         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6700
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz reht sie wol behielt<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4698" id="v4698" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4698" tabindex="-1">v4698</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6701
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>swie sie der kivskeit wîelte 4700<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4699" id="v4699" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4699" tabindex="-1">v4699</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6702
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>diu in dem himel oben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4700" id="v4700" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4700" tabindex="-1">v4700</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6703
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>iemer ist ze loben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4701" id="v4701" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4701" tabindex="-1">v4701</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6704
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sie zunte ir liehte cherzen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4702" id="v4702" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4702" tabindex="-1">v4702</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6705
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div ie in dem herzen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4703" id="v4703" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4703" tabindex="-1">v4703</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6706
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>liehter was denne div sunne 4705<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4704" id="v4704" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4704" tabindex="-1">v4704</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6707
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
