         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6709
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da ir got mit gedahte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4707" id="v4707" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4707" tabindex="-1">v4707</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6710
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wan under den uogeln allen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4708" id="v4708" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4708" tabindex="-1">v4708</a>
