         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6711
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>niht me lebet ane gallen 4710<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4709" id="v4709" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4709" tabindex="-1">v4709</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6712
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>niht so gutes V so reines<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4710" id="v4710" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4710" tabindex="-1">v4710</a>
