         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4713" id="v4713" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4713" tabindex="-1">v4713</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6720
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>dar chom der alte Simeon 4715<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4714" id="v4714" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4714" tabindex="-1">v4714</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6721
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>dem hete got ze Ion<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4715" id="v4715" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4715" tabindex="-1">v4715</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6722
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sines gedinges daz geben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4716" id="v4716" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4716" tabindex="-1">v4716</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6723
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz er so lange mvse leben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4717" id="v4717" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4717" tabindex="-1">v4717</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6724
