         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6726
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν in froliche gessehe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4720" id="v4720" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4720" tabindex="-1">v4720</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6727
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des der himel ze herren iaelie<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4721" id="v4721" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4721" tabindex="-1">v4721</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6728
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do hub er in ûf mit fröde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4722" id="v4722" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4722" tabindex="-1">v4722</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
