         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des herzelieber beschoude<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4723" id="v4723" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4723" tabindex="-1">v4723</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6730
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν des gnaden er gerte 4725<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4724" id="v4724" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4724" tabindex="-1">v4724</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6731
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er sprah nu bin ich gewerte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4725" id="v4725" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4725" tabindex="-1">v4725</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6732
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>herre des ich ie bat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4726" id="v4726" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4726" tabindex="-1">v4726</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6733
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>du hast mich braht an die stat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4727" id="v4727" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4727" tabindex="-1">v4727</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6734
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ih din heil gesehen han<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4728" id="v4728" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4728" tabindex="-1">v4728</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6735
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nu scholt du mich varn lân 4730<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4729" id="v4729" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4729" tabindex="-1">v4729</a>
