         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6749
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6750
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6751
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6752
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6753
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4733" id="v4733" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4733" tabindex="-1">v4733</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6754
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Ein witwe diu hiez Anne 4735<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4734" id="v4734" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4734" tabindex="-1">v4734</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6755
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>diu was gewesen lange<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4735" id="v4735" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4735" tabindex="-1">v4735</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6756
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in dem gotes hfl se<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4736" id="v4736" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4736" tabindex="-1">v4736</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6757
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des nahtes ane grñse<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4737" id="v4737" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4737" tabindex="-1">v4737</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6758
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie (ir) nien uorhte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4738" id="v4738" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4738" tabindex="-1">v4738</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6759
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>anders sie niht enworhte 4740<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4739" id="v4739" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4739" tabindex="-1">v4739</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6760
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wan daz sie ir gebetes hüte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4740" id="v4740" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4740" tabindex="-1">v4740</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6761
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div staete V diu vil gute<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4741" id="v4741" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4741" tabindex="-1">v4741</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6762
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>zseigete uf den heilant<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4742" id="v4742" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4742" tabindex="-1">v4742</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6763
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vnt umbeviench in zehant<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6764
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6765
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6766
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4743" id="v4743" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4743" tabindex="-1">v4743</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6767
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sie sprah daz er ware 4745<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4744" id="v4744" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4744" tabindex="-1">v4744</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6768
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der werlte schepfaere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4745" id="v4745" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4745" tabindex="-1">v4745</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6769
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der mit mennisklicher wat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4746" id="v4746" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4746" tabindex="-1">v4746</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6770
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sin herschaft bedecket hat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4747" id="v4747" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4747" tabindex="-1">v4747</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6771
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er wserez der riche Christ<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4748" id="v4748" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4748" tabindex="-1">v4748</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6772
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der rehten trost der armen genist 4750<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4749" id="v4749" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4749" tabindex="-1">v4749</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6773
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do heter urkundes genuch<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4750" id="v4750" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4750" tabindex="-1">v4750</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6774
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div mater div in truch<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4751" id="v4751" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4751" tabindex="-1">v4751</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6775
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uil werde ir da gesah<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4752" id="v4752" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4752" tabindex="-1">v4752</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6776
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sin lop daz was ir gemach<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
