         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6781
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6782
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6783
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6784
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4753" id="v4753" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4753" tabindex="-1">v4753</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6785
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>von gote birn wir alle samet 4755<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4754" id="v4754" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4754" tabindex="-1">v4754</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6786
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>an disen dingen gemanet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4755" id="v4755" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4755" tabindex="-1">v4755</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6787
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so wir ze chirchen gen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4756" id="v4756" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4756" tabindex="-1">v4756</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6788
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz wir da zuhteklichen sten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4757" id="v4757" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4757" tabindex="-1">v4757</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6789
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>V daz wir uon herzen meinen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6790
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6791
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
