         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6792
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4758" id="v4758" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4758" tabindex="-1">v4758</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6793
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ob al der werlte in einen 4760<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4759" id="v4759" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4759" tabindex="-1">v4759</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6794
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der uns uon nihte geschuf<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4760" id="v4760" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4760" tabindex="-1">v4760</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6795
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>unser gebet ν unsern rvf<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4761" id="v4761" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4761" tabindex="-1">v4761</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6796
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>schulen wir an in wenden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4762" id="v4762" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4762" tabindex="-1">v4762</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6797
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ia mag er wol uerenden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4763" id="v4763" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4763" tabindex="-1">v4763</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6798
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>swaz uns sorgen obelit 4765<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4764" id="v4764" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4764" tabindex="-1">v4764</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6799
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er ist der die gnade git<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4765" id="v4765" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4765" tabindex="-1">v4765</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6800
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div iemer wert ane wanch<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4766" id="v4766" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4766" tabindex="-1">v4766</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6801
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>aller wisheit anvanch<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4767" id="v4767" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4767" tabindex="-1">v4767</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6802
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er ist oh diu ware minne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4768" id="v4768" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4768" tabindex="-1">v4768</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6803
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>diu da unser sinne 4770<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4769" id="v4769" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4769" tabindex="-1">v4769</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6804
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>erznnten sol mit sinem vivre<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4770" id="v4770" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4770" tabindex="-1">v4770</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6805
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>dazu hat er uns ze stiure<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4771" id="v4771" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4771" tabindex="-1">v4771</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6806
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sine muter geben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4772" id="v4772" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4772" tabindex="-1">v4772</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6807
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die uns daz ewige leben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4773" id="v4773" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4773" tabindex="-1">v4773</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6808
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uil wol mak erwerben 4775<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4774" id="v4774" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4774" tabindex="-1">v4774</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6809
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die in ir hulden ersterben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6810
