         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6814
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6815
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6816
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6817
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6818
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6819
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4775" id="v4775" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4775" tabindex="-1">v4775</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6820
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Do daz msere chom geflogen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4776" id="v4776" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4776" tabindex="-1">v4776</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6821
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz Herodes was betrogen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4777" id="v4777" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4777" tabindex="-1">v4777</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6822
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uon den kunigen drien<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4778" id="v4778" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4778" tabindex="-1">v4778</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6823
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uor leide began er schrien 4780<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4779" id="v4779" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4779" tabindex="-1">v4779</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6824
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>als er toben Wolde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4780" id="v4780" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4780" tabindex="-1">v4780</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6825
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er sprah daz er sie mit golde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4781" id="v4781" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4781" tabindex="-1">v4781</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6826
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wider woege alle<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4782" id="v4782" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4782" tabindex="-1">v4782</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6827
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in ze schänden ν ze ualle<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6828
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6829
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6830
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6831
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6832
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4783" id="v4783" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4783" tabindex="-1">v4783</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6833
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie im niht boten sanden 4785<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4784" id="v4784" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4784" tabindex="-1">v4784</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6834
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do in Christ chom ze handen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4785" id="v4785" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4785" tabindex="-1">v4785</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6835
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>als sie heten gelobet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4786" id="v4786" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4786" tabindex="-1">v4786</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6836
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do was den herren so gezoget<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6837
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4787" id="v4787" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4787" tabindex="-1">v4787</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6838
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie wol entwichen waren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4788" id="v4788" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4788" tabindex="-1">v4788</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6839
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz er nîen mohte ire geuaren 4790<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4789" id="v4789" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4789" tabindex="-1">v4789</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6840
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>doh hiez er in nah riten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4790" id="v4790" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4790" tabindex="-1">v4790</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6841
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>v suchen also witen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4791" id="v4791" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4791" tabindex="-1">v4791</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6842
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do daz niht uervie<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4792" id="v4792" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4792" tabindex="-1">v4792</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6843
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ze rate er mit grimme gie<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4793" id="v4793" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4793" tabindex="-1">v4793</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6844
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit sinen mortgelichen 4795<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4794" id="v4794" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4794" tabindex="-1">v4794</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6845
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die rieten oh im tobelichen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4795" id="v4795" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4795" tabindex="-1">v4795</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6846
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz man div kint elliv ersluge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4796" id="v4796" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4796" tabindex="-1">v4796</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6847
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so gahes mit der fuge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4797" id="v4797" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4797" tabindex="-1">v4797</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6848
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz Christ under in uerdurbe<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4798" id="v4798" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4798" tabindex="-1">v4798</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6849
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>e daz er uerborgen wrde 4800<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6850
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6851
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6852
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6853
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6854
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6855
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6856
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
