         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6868
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6869
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6870
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6871
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4799" id="v4799" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4799" tabindex="-1">v4799</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6872
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>So we dir untriwe daz du bist<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4800" id="v4800" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4800" tabindex="-1">v4800</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6873
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sie wanten daz der list<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4801" id="v4801" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4801" tabindex="-1">v4801</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6874
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da ze got uerholn wsere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4802" id="v4802" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4802" tabindex="-1">v4802</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6875
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des tieuels uolgaere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4803" id="v4803" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4803" tabindex="-1">v4803</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6876
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>10 die waren daran erblendet 4805<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4804" id="v4804" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4804" tabindex="-1">v4804</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6877
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>gehonet ν geschendet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4805" id="v4805" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4805" tabindex="-1">v4805</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6878
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der magede sun uil wol genas<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4806" id="v4806" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4806" tabindex="-1">v4806</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6879
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz Herodis wille was<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4807" id="v4807" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4807" tabindex="-1">v4807</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6880
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz enmohte niht ergen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4808" id="v4808" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4808" tabindex="-1">v4808</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6881
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ein engil chom ze Bethlehem 4810<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4809" id="v4809" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4809" tabindex="-1">v4809</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6882
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Ioseben er anharte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4810" id="v4810" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4810" tabindex="-1">v4810</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6883
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz er daz kint bewarte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4811" id="v4811" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4811" tabindex="-1">v4811</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6884
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er hiez in wesen muntir<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4812" id="v4812" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4812" tabindex="-1">v4812</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6885
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν seit im oh dar untir<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4813" id="v4813" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4813" tabindex="-1">v4813</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6886
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>15 die kumftigen sorgen 4815<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4814" id="v4814" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4814" tabindex="-1">v4814</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6887
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div dannoch was uerborgen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4815" id="v4815" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4815" tabindex="-1">v4815</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6888
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in des kunges eitirgem rate<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4816" id="v4816" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4816" tabindex="-1">v4816</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6889
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er mant in ilen drate<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4817" id="v4817" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4817" tabindex="-1">v4817</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6890
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz er fürte den heilant<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6891
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
