         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6892
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uerre in Egiptelant 4820<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4819" id="v4819" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4819" tabindex="-1">v4819</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6893
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>under die heideniske diet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4820" id="v4820" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4820" tabindex="-1">v4820</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6894
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz gebot er ν geriet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4821" id="v4821" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4821" tabindex="-1">v4821</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6895
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz er sih da enthabete<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4822" id="v4822" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4822" tabindex="-1">v4822</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6896
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>untzer im aue sagete<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4823" id="v4823" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4823" tabindex="-1">v4823</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6897
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des frote sih diu maget mit dem alten 4825<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4824" id="v4824" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4824" tabindex="-1">v4824</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6898
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
