         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v6910
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der wolte ditze irdiske lant<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4833" id="v4833" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4833" tabindex="-1">v4833</a>
