         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7026
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>owi welhifrfen welhchlagen 4920<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4919" id="v4919" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4919" tabindex="-1">v4919</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7027
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da div kint waren in der not<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4920" id="v4920" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4920" tabindex="-1">v4920</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7028
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>halplebentige ? halp tot<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4921" id="v4921" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4921" tabindex="-1">v4921</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7029
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
