         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4949" id="v4949" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4949" tabindex="-1">v4949</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7106
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Got selbe wolte rechen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4950" id="v4950" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4950" tabindex="-1">v4950</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7107
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die ubermut zebrechen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4951" id="v4951" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4951" tabindex="-1">v4951</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7108
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die Herodes fürte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4952" id="v4952" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4952" tabindex="-1">v4952</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7109
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ze Christes gáfeinwrte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4953" id="v4953" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4953" tabindex="-1">v4953</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7110
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>gote Wolter angesigen 4955<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4954" id="v4954" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4954" tabindex="-1">v4954</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7111
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do mäser schantliche geiigen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4955" id="v4955" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4955" tabindex="-1">v4955</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7112
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ze einer churzen friste<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4956" id="v4956" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4956" tabindex="-1">v4956</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7113
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>waz hülfen in die liste<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4957" id="v4957" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4957" tabindex="-1">v4957</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7114
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der sin herze uol swebete<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4958" id="v4958" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4958" tabindex="-1">v4958</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7115
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do er mit untrivwen lebete? 4960<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4959" id="v4959" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4959" tabindex="-1">v4959</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7116
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>waz hilfet daz silber oder golt<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4960" id="v4960" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4960" tabindex="-1">v4960</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7117
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da der bose niht uerdolt<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4961" id="v4961" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4961" tabindex="-1">v4961</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7118
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>rehter tugende invart?<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4962" id="v4962" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4962" tabindex="-1">v4962</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7119
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der schätze niemen des bewart<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4963" id="v4963" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4963" tabindex="-1">v4963</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7120
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>erne muzze ersterben 4965<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4964" id="v4964" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4964" tabindex="-1">v4964</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7121
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν ze valwiske werden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4965" id="v4965" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4965" tabindex="-1">v4965</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7122
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Herodes begunde siechen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4966" id="v4966" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4966" tabindex="-1">v4966</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7123
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz uf den betteziechen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4967" id="v4967" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4967" tabindex="-1">v4967</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7124
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>swebet blftt ν warch<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4968" id="v4968" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4968" tabindex="-1">v4968</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7125
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div suht div wart also starch 4970<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4969" id="v4969" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4969" tabindex="-1">v4969</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7126
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz er gar fulen began<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4970" id="v4970" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4970" tabindex="-1">v4970</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7127
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nie mennisk mère note gewan<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
