         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4971" id="v4971" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4971" tabindex="-1">v4971</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7131
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν unsaelde also uil<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4972" id="v4972" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4972" tabindex="-1">v4972</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7132
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>deheine wnne noh dehein spil<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4973" id="v4973" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4973" tabindex="-1">v4973</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7133
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>maht er geschòen uf der erde 4975<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4974" id="v4974" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4974" tabindex="-1">v4974</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7134
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν smachte vil unwerde<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
