         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4975" id="v4975" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4975" tabindex="-1">v4975</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7136
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>an allen sinen liden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4976" id="v4976" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4976" tabindex="-1">v4976</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7137
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>sin gewalt enmohte daz niht gefriden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4977" id="v4977" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4977" tabindex="-1">v4977</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7138
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>eme muse leitlichen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4978" id="v4978" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4978" tabindex="-1">v4978</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7139
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
