         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4979" id="v4979" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4979" tabindex="-1">v4979</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7143
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Mit den nageln zart er die hut<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4980" id="v4980" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4980" tabindex="-1">v4980</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7144
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er was uil armeklichen lut<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4981" id="v4981" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4981" tabindex="-1">v4981</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7145
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die wisen arzate<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4982" id="v4982" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4982" tabindex="-1">v4982</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7146
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>chunden im niht geraten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4983" id="v4983" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4983" tabindex="-1">v4983</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7147
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit wrzen noh mit salben 4985<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4984" id="v4984" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4984" tabindex="-1">v4984</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7148
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er brah sih allenthalben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4985" id="v4985" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4985" tabindex="-1">v4985</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7149
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uzzen unt innen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4986" id="v4986" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4986" tabindex="-1">v4986</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7150
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do entwichen im die sinne<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4987" id="v4987" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4987" tabindex="-1">v4987</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7151
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>michel wart sin unzuht<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
