         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7153
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do dewanch in öh div tobesuht 4990<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4989" id="v4989" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4989" tabindex="-1">v4989</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7154
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz er armer y unreine<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4990" id="v4990" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4990" tabindex="-1">v4990</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7155
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ab einem hohen steine<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4991" id="v4991" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4991" tabindex="-1">v4991</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7156
