         </span>sih selben erualte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4992" id="v4992" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4992" tabindex="-1">v4992</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7157
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da nam in der tieuel ze gwalte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
