         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7160
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Ce Iosep der engel do sprach 4995<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4994" id="v4994" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4994" tabindex="-1">v4994</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7161
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ende hat din ungemah<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4995" id="v4995" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4995" tabindex="-1">v4995</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7162
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wider ze lande scholt du varn<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4996" id="v4996" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4996" tabindex="-1">v4996</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7163
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>des kindes viande sint ueruarn<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7164
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7165
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7166
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7167
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7168
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4997" id="v4997" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4997" tabindex="-1">v4997</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7169
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν uon der werlte gescheiden<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4998" id="v4998" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4998" tabindex="-1">v4998</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7170
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nu heue dich hêim uon den heiden 5000<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v4999" id="v4999" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v4999" tabindex="-1">v4999</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7171
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν wizze daz der heilige Christ<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7172
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7173
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7174
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5000" id="v5000" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5000" tabindex="-1">v5000</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7175
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>swaz uon ime gescriben ist<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5001" id="v5001" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5001" tabindex="-1">v5001</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7176
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz wil er in Iudea began<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5002" id="v5002" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5002" tabindex="-1">v5002</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7177
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da erhebet sih sunder wân<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5003" id="v5003" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5003" tabindex="-1">v5003</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7178
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz heil der Christenheit 5005<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5004" id="v5004" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5004" tabindex="-1">v5004</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7179
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>als ez uor ist gewîssoeit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5005" id="v5005" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5005" tabindex="-1">v5005</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7180
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>V als er hat geheizzen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5006" id="v5006" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5006" tabindex="-1">v5006</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7181
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der bome ist gemeizzen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5007" id="v5007" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5007" tabindex="-1">v5007</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7182
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>da daz heilwsege non beckumet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5008" id="v5008" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5008" tabindex="-1">v5008</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7183
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>'daz aller werlte gefrumet'' 5010'<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7184
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7185
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7186
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7187
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7188
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7189
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7190
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7191
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5009" id="v5009" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5009" tabindex="-1">v5009</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7192
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Iosep cherte do hêin<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5010" id="v5010" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5010" tabindex="-1">v5010</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7193
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>als im der morgen erschêin<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5011" id="v5011" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5011" tabindex="-1">v5011</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7194
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit sinem iuncherren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5012" id="v5012" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5012" tabindex="-1">v5012</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7195
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν der magede nil heren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5013" id="v5013" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5013" tabindex="-1">v5013</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7196
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>gewerren enmohte im niht 5015<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5014" id="v5014" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5014" tabindex="-1">v5014</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7197
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uon deheiner ubeln geschiht<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5015" id="v5015" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5015" tabindex="-1">v5015</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7198
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>noh uon fîentlicher läge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5016" id="v5016" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5016" tabindex="-1">v5016</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7199
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der e uon sinen magen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7200
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7201
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7202
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7203
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5017" id="v5017" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5017" tabindex="-1">v5017</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7204
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nahtes was entrunnen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5018" id="v5018" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5018" tabindex="-1">v5018</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7205
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der iure bi liehter sunnen 5020<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5019" id="v5019" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5019" tabindex="-1">v5019</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7206
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wider in sin gessezze<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5020" id="v5020" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5020" tabindex="-1">v5020</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7207
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Herodes der uil raezze<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5021" id="v5021" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5021" tabindex="-1">v5021</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7208
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der enmate in niht mere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5022" id="v5022" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5022" tabindex="-1">v5022</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7209
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>er was geuallen sere<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5023" id="v5023" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5023" tabindex="-1">v5023</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7210
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Also miiz ez allen den ergen 5025<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5024" id="v5024" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5024" tabindex="-1">v5024</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7211
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die got wellent widersten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5025" id="v5025" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5025" tabindex="-1">v5025</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7212
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>unt siner ordinunge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5026" id="v5026" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5026" tabindex="-1">v5026</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7213
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>dise wamunge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7214
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5027" id="v5027" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5027" tabindex="-1">v5027</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7215
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>diu ist iv uor gezellet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5028" id="v5028" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5028" tabindex="-1">v5028</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7216
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ob ir genesen wellet 5030<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5029" id="v5029" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5029" tabindex="-1">v5029</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7217
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz ir die werlte schîvhet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5030" id="v5030" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5030" tabindex="-1">v5030</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7218
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>diu hinze helle zivhet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5031" id="v5031" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5031" tabindex="-1">v5031</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7219
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vnt fliehet irdisken hört<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5032" id="v5032" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5032" tabindex="-1">v5032</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7220
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>durh daz gotes wort<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5033" id="v5033" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5033" tabindex="-1">v5033</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7221
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>10 daz ane zwiuel gestat 5035<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7222
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5034" id="v5034" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5034" tabindex="-1">v5034</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7223
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so himel vnt erde zergat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5035" id="v5035" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5035" tabindex="-1">v5035</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7224
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>bewart ivch mit stseter hüte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7225
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5036" id="v5036" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5036" tabindex="-1">v5036</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7226
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uor der ubermvte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5037" id="v5037" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5037" tabindex="-1">v5037</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7227
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>div iemer uallen muz<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5038" id="v5038" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5038" tabindex="-1">v5038</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7228
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vnt nie gewan statigen fñz 5040<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5039" id="v5039" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5039" tabindex="-1">v5039</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7229
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>gedenehet wie ez ergie<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5040" id="v5040" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5040" tabindex="-1">v5040</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7230
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>dem tievil do er geuie<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5041" id="v5041" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5041" tabindex="-1">v5041</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7231
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>hohfart V hohenmut<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5042" id="v5042" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5042" tabindex="-1">v5042</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7232
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>do wart er ane wafen ν ane blüt<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5043" id="v5043" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5043" tabindex="-1">v5043</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7233
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>lo uon al den eren gestozzen 5045<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5044" id="v5044" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5044" tabindex="-1">v5044</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7234
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit sinen stritgenozzen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5045" id="v5045" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5045" tabindex="-1">v5045</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7235
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>vut nniz ewiklich ersterben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5046" id="v5046" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5046" tabindex="-1">v5046</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7236
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>also muzzen sie uerderben<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
