         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7245
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5047" id="v5047" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5047" tabindex="-1">v5047</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7246
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die sih zu im gepflihtent<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5048" id="v5048" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5048" tabindex="-1">v5048</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7247
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>unde sih ze hohe rihtent 5050<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5049" id="v5049" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5049" tabindex="-1">v5049</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7248
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ane werltlichen sachen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5050" id="v5050" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5050" tabindex="-1">v5050</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7249
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ην ruche uns got gemachen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5051" id="v5051" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5051" tabindex="-1">v5051</a>
