         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7250
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>im selben genoeme<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5052" id="v5052" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5052" tabindex="-1">v5052</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7251
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>werde vnt· gezseme<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5053" id="v5053" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5053" tabindex="-1">v5053</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7252
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>20 daz wir hernah geniezzen 5055<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5054" id="v5054" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5054" tabindex="-1">v5054</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7253
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>s sent Marien der suzzen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5055" id="v5055" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5055" tabindex="-1">v5055</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7254
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ν der muter der eren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5056" id="v5056" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5056" tabindex="-1">v5056</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7255
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so wir hinnen cheren<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5057" id="v5057" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5057" tabindex="-1">v5057</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7256
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>ir gnade ist so manekvalte<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
