         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7257
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5058" id="v5058" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5058" tabindex="-1">v5058</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7258
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>diu in sinem gewalte 5060<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5059" id="v5059" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5059" tabindex="-1">v5059</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7259
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den himel hat besezzen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5060" id="v5060" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5060" tabindex="-1">v5060</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7260
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>dane schol sie niht vergezzen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5061" id="v5061" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5061" tabindex="-1">v5061</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7261
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
