         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7603
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>Bezzer froe nie wart<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5066" id="v5066" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5066" tabindex="-1">v5066</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7604
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>mit grozzen trivwen sie bewart<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5067" id="v5067" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5067" tabindex="-1">v5067</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7605
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>den s seligen zaller zit<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
