         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7607
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>swer sih innekliche ergit 5070<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5069" id="v5069" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5069" tabindex="-1">v5069</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7608
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>uf ir grozze barmunge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5070" id="v5070" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5070" tabindex="-1">v5070</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7609
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>dane mohte dehein zunge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5071" id="v5071" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5071" tabindex="-1">v5071</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7610
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>30 ze reht wol beduten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5072" id="v5072" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5072" tabindex="-1">v5072</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7611
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wie sie weget den livten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5073" id="v5073" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5073" tabindex="-1">v5073</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7612
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>an unsers herren fuzzen 5075<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5074" id="v5074" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5074" tabindex="-1">v5074</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7613
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>swes wir sie begruzzen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5075" id="v5075" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5075" tabindex="-1">v5075</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7614
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz enlat sie ir niht beslifen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5076" id="v5076" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5076" tabindex="-1">v5076</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7615
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>nu bechort sie begrifen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5077" id="v5077" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5077" tabindex="-1">v5077</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7616
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie iu niht enge<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5078" id="v5078" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5078" tabindex="-1">v5078</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7617
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>so muget ir da nah iemer mê 5080<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5079" id="v5079" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5079" tabindex="-1">v5079</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7618
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wesen ungeschendet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5080" id="v5080" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5080" tabindex="-1">v5080</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7619
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>35 want sie nnser leit wol uerendet<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
