         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7670
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>got mag ir niht uerzihen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5095" id="v5095" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5095" tabindex="-1">v5095</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7671
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>der sie im gewihet hat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5096" id="v5096" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5096" tabindex="-1">v5096</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7672
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>über al sine hantgetat<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
