         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7675
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wir sitzen oder sten<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5098" id="v5098" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5098" tabindex="-1">v5098</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7676
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>in ire hulden schuln wir gen 5100<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5099" id="v5099" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5099" tabindex="-1">v5099</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7677
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wir ezzen oder trinchen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5100" id="v5100" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5100" tabindex="-1">v5100</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7678
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wir schuln ir îe gedenchen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line synTexView-omitted" data-n="v" id="v" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v" tabindex="-1">v</a>
