         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7680
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wir slafen oder wachen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5102" id="v5102" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5102" tabindex="-1">v5102</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7681
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>wir schvln an allen sachen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5103" id="v5103" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5103" tabindex="-1">v5103</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7682
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>die guten vnt die reinen 5105<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5104" id="v5104" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5104" tabindex="-1">v5104</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7683
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>flegen unde meinen<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5105" id="v5105" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5105" tabindex="-1">v5105</a>
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span><span class="synTexView-linenr-local">v7684
         &nbsp;&nbsp;
         </span>daz sie in dem himelriche<br></span><span class="synTexView-line normal" data-n="v5106" id="v5106" tabindex="-1"><span class="synTexView-linenr-global"><a href="./.html#v5106" tabindex="-1">v5106</a>
